    introduction: "H\xE3y h\u1ECDc tr\xECnh t\u1EF1 ch\xEDnh tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u c\xE1c ph\xE1n quy\u1EBFt chi ti\u1EBFt c\u1EE7a tr\u01B0\u1EDDng ph\xE1i jurisprudence c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n.",
