      "Sau takbir th\u1EE9 ba, h\xE3y th\xE0nh t\xE2m c\u1EA7u xin cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 m\u1EA5t.",
      "Sau takbir th\u1EE9 t\u01B0, h\xE3y d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt v\xE0 k\u1EBFt th\xFAc b\u1EB1ng salam."
