  "A plain web page carrying the same official feed, for when a phone browser is easier than the YouTube app.": "YouTube uygulamas\u0131 yerine telefon taray\u0131c\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n daha kolay oldu\u011Fu anlar i\xE7in ayn\u0131 resm\xEE yay\u0131n\u0131 ta\u015F\u0131yan sade bir web sayfas\u0131.",
