  "A stretch of verses, both ends included \u2014 for learning a passage.": "\u0130ki ucu dahil bir ayet dizisi \u2014 bir b\xF6l\xFCm\xFC \xF6\u011Frenmek i\xE7in.",
  "A tafsir, not a translation": "Bir tefsir, meal de\u011Fil",
  "A thin folding prayer mat and unscented wipes": "\u0130nce katlan\u0131r bir seccade ve kokusuz mendiller",
  "A valid fast requires sincere intention and abstention from invalidators during the fasting day.": "Ge\xE7erli bir oru\xE7, samimi bir niyet ve oru\xE7 g\xFCn\xFC boyunca orucu bozan \u015Feylerden sak\u0131nmay\u0131 gerektirir.",
  "A verse or hadith each day": "Her g\xFCn bir ayet veya hadis",
  "A white, clear discharge released at the end of the cycle. The Prophet \uFDFA described it to Umm Atiyya as the sign that bleeding has ended, and women of the early generations would send word of it to one another.": "D\xF6ng\xFCn\xFCn sonunda gelen beyaz, berrak bir ak\u0131nt\u0131. Peygamber \uFDFA bunu \xDCmm\xFC Atiyye\u2019ye kanaman\u0131n bitti\u011Finin i\u015Fareti olarak anlatt\u0131 ve ilk nesillerin kad\u0131nlar\u0131 bunu birbirlerine haber verirlerdi.",
  "A word at a time, and every root learned is a door that stays open long after these days have passed. Ten days of ten words is a hundred words carried into the rest of the year.": "Birer birer kelime, ve \xF6\u011Frenilen her k\xF6k bu g\xFCnler ge\xE7tikten \xE7ok sonra da a\xE7\u0131k kalan bir kap\u0131d\u0131r. G\xFCnde on kelimelik on g\xFCn, y\u0131l\u0131n geri kalan\u0131na ta\u015F\u0131nan y\xFCz kelimedir.",
