  "Adhan, a quiet reminder before each prayer, and a verse each morning. Every one of these can be switched off later, and nothing is scheduled until you allow it.": "Ezan, her namazdan \xF6nce sessiz bir hat\u0131rlatma ve her sabah bir ayet. Bunlar\u0131n her biri sonra kapat\u0131labilir ve siz izin vermeden hi\xE7biri planlanmaz.",
