  "And what could make thee conceive what it is, that Night of Destiny?": "Kadir Gecesi\u2019nin ne oldu\u011Funu sana ne bildirdi?",
  "Android is not allowing this app to set exact alarms, so the adhan cannot be timed to the prayer. Your notification tone will sound instead. Allow alarms and it will play properly.": "Android bu uygulaman\u0131n kesin alarmlar kurmas\u0131na izin vermiyor, bu y\xFCzden ezan namaz vaktine ayarlanam\u0131yor. Onun yerine bildirim sesiniz duyulur. Alarmlara izin verin, d\xFCzg\xFCn \xE7alar.",
  "Android sometimes delays alarms for apps it thinks are idle, which can make the adhan arrive late. Exempting this app takes one tap.": "Android bazen bo\u015Fta oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFC uygulamalar\u0131n alarmlar\u0131n\u0131 geciktirir; bu da ezan\u0131n ge\xE7 gelmesine yol a\xE7abilir. Bu uygulamay\u0131 muaf tutmak bir dokunu\u015F al\u0131r.",
  "Android will not delay this app\u2019s reminders while it is saving power.": "Android, g\xFC\xE7 tasarrufu yaparken bu uygulaman\u0131n hat\u0131rlatmalar\u0131n\u0131 geciktirmez.",
  "Another sets no minimum at all, and counts any bleeding as hayd once it has begun.": "Bir di\u011Feri hi\xE7bir asgari s\xFCre koymaz ve ba\u015Flad\u0131ktan sonra her kanamay\u0131 hay\u0131z sayar.",
  "Anxiety and distress": "Kayg\u0131 ve s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131",
  "Any fast already missed in the hayd portion is still owed, and belongs on the Qada screen.": "Hay\u0131z k\u0131sm\u0131nda ka\xE7\u0131r\u0131lan her oru\xE7 h\xE2l\xE2 bor\xE7tur ve Kaza ekran\u0131na aittir.",
