  "Assimilation of m\u012Bm s\u0101kin into a following m\u012Bm.": "Sakin m\u012Bm\u2019in ard\u0131ndan gelen bir m\u012Bm\u2019e idgam\u0131.",
  "Assimilation without nasal resonance.": "Geniz sesi olmadan idgam.",
  "Astaghfirullah": "Esta\u011Ffirullah",
  "At Mina, stone the large pillar (al-\u2018Aqabah, the one nearest Makkah) with seven pebbles, saying \u201CAll\u0101hu akbar\u201D with each throw. With this stoning the greater release from Ihram takes effect.": "Mina\u2019da, b\xFCy\xFCk cemreyi (Mekke\u2019ye en yak\u0131n olan Akabe cemresi) yedi \xE7ak\u0131l ta\u015F\u0131yla ta\u015Flay\u0131n ve her at\u0131\u015Fta \u201CAllahu ekber\u201D deyin. Bu ta\u015Flamayla ihramdan b\xFCy\xFCk \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F ger\xE7ekle\u015Fir.",
  "At each prayer time, with buttons to silence it or to mark the prayer as prayed.": "Her namaz vaktinde, susturmak veya namaz\u0131 k\u0131l\u0131nd\u0131 i\u015Faretlemek i\xE7in d\xFC\u011Fmelerle.",
