  "Avoid claiming certainty about a particular night.": "Belirli bir gece hakk\u0131nda kesinlik iddia etmekten ka\xE7\u0131n\u0131n.",
  "Avoid food, drink, marital relations, and deliberate invalidators until sunset.": "G\xFCn bat\u0131m\u0131na kadar yeme, i\xE7me, cinsel ili\u015Fki ve kasten orucu bozan \u015Feylerden sak\u0131n\u0131n.",
