  "Bank and savings": "Banka ve birikimler",
  "Bathe and dress in the Ihram garments, then make the intention for the rites you have chosen and begin the Talbiyah. The prohibitions of Ihram now apply until you have stoned, sacrificed and shaved or trimmed.": "Y\u0131kan\u0131n ve ihram giysilerini giyin, sonra se\xE7ti\u011Finiz menasike niyet edin ve Telbiye\u2019ye ba\u015Flay\u0131n. \u0130hram yasaklar\u0131 art\u0131k ta\u015Flay\u0131p kurban kesip t\u0131ra\u015F olana veya sa\xE7\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 k\u0131saltana kadar ge\xE7erlidir.",
  "Bathe, dress, intend, and begin the Talbiyah": "Y\u0131kan\u0131n, giyinin, niyet edin ve Telbiye\u2019ye ba\u015Flay\u0131n",
  "Battery": "Pil",
  "Battery saving may delay the adhan": "Pil tasarrufu ezan\u0131 geciktirebilir",
