  "Before the next Ramadan": "Bir sonraki Ramazan\u2019dan \xF6nce",
  "Before travelling home, perform seven circuits as the farewell Tawaf, then pray two rak\u2018ahs and leave. It is the last rite of the Hajj for anyone leaving Makkah.": "Eve d\xF6nmeden \xF6nce veda tavaf\u0131 olarak yedi \u015Favt yap\u0131n, sonra iki rek\xE2t namaz k\u0131l\u0131n ve ayr\u0131l\u0131n. Mekke\u2019den ayr\u0131lan herkes i\xE7in bu Hac\u2019\u0131n son menasikidir.",
  "Before you sleep": "Uyumadan \xF6nce",
