  "Bismillah": "Bismillah",
  "Bleeding after childbirth is commonly counted up to 40 days.": "Do\u011Fum sonras\u0131 kanama yayg\u0131n olarak 40 g\xFCne kadar say\u0131l\u0131r.",
  "Bleeding after childbirth is commonly counted up to {n} days.": "Do\u011Fum sonras\u0131 kanama yayg\u0131n olarak {n} g\xFCne kadar say\u0131l\u0131r.",
  "Bleeding after childbirth is counted as nifas while it lasts, up to the outer limit. Its rules follow those of hayd for the days it runs.": "Do\u011Fum sonras\u0131 kanama, d\u0131\u015F s\u0131n\u0131ra kadar s\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFC m\xFCddet\xE7e nifas say\u0131l\u0131r. S\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFC g\xFCnlerde h\xFCk\xFCmleri hay\u0131z\u0131n h\xFCk\xFCmlerine uyar.",
  "Bleeding days": "Kanama g\xFCnleri",
  "Bleeding is not always hayd, and the difference decides whether the prayer and the fast are due. Answer the two questions below and the app will hold them against your own pattern and against the limits commonly cited.": "Kanama her zaman hayz de\u011Fildir ve fark, namaz ile orucun gerekip gerekmedi\u011Fini belirler. A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki iki soruyu yan\u0131tlay\u0131n; uygulama bunlar\u0131 kendi d\xFCzeninizle ve yayg\u0131n olarak aktar\u0131lan s\u0131n\u0131rlarla kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r.",
  "Bleeding outside the pattern of hayd or nifas: ongoing spotting, a wound, or bleeding that runs past the limits above. It does not prevent the prayer or the fast. The well-known guidance is to wash, protect the area, and make wudu for the time of each prayer rather than once for the day.": "Hay\u0131z veya nifas d\xFCzeninin d\u0131\u015F\u0131ndaki kanama: s\xFCregelen lekelenme, bir yara veya yukar\u0131daki s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 a\u015Fan kanama. Namaza veya oruca engel de\u011Fildir. Bilinen yol, y\u0131kanmak, b\xF6lgeyi korumak ve g\xFCnde bir kez de\u011Fil her namaz vakti i\xE7in abdest almakt\u0131r.",
  "Bleeding that begins inside that gap is not counted as a new period.": "O bo\u015Fluk i\xE7inde ba\u015Flayan kanama yeni bir d\xF6nem say\u0131lmaz.",
  "Bleeding that continues past the outer limit is treated as istihada from that point.": "D\u0131\u015F s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 a\u015Fan kanama o noktadan itibaren istihaza say\u0131l\u0131r.",
  "Bleeding that is not a period": "Hayz olmayan kanama",
