  "Complete dryness: nothing at all is seen when checking, so the place remains clean and dry. For many women this is the clearer of the two signs, and it is reached a day or two after the discharge stops.": "Tam kuruluk: kontrol edildi\u011Finde hi\xE7bir \u015Fey g\xF6r\xFClmez, b\xF6ylece yer temiz ve kuru kal\u0131r. Bir\xE7ok kad\u0131n i\xE7in bu iki i\u015Faretten daha a\xE7\u0131k olan\u0131d\u0131r ve ak\u0131nt\u0131 kesildikten bir iki g\xFCn sonra ula\u015F\u0131l\u0131r.",
