  "Days fasted in each month, oldest first.": "Her ayda tutulan oru\xE7 g\xFCnleri, en eskiden ba\u015Flayarak.",
  "Days missed through hayd or nifas are made up one for one. There is no fidyah on them, because fidyah belongs to the one who cannot make the day up at all. A woman who can fast later fasts later.": "Hay\u0131z veya nifas y\xFCz\xFCnden ka\xE7\u0131r\u0131lan g\xFCnler bire bir kaza edilir. Onlar i\xE7in fidye yoktur, \xE7\xFCnk\xFC fidye o g\xFCn\xFC hi\xE7 kaza edemeyecek olana aittir. Sonra oru\xE7 tutabilen kad\u0131n sonra tutar.",
  "Days of Ramadan missed through menstruation or post-natal bleeding are made up before the next Ramadan, one day for each day. They do not need to be consecutive, and they may be spread through the year \u2014 but they are a debt, so most women keep a running count. This area records those days for you and keeps the scorecard honest as you settle them.": "\xC2det veya do\u011Fum sonras\u0131 kanama y\xFCz\xFCnden tutulamayan Ramazan g\xFCnleri, bir sonraki Ramazan\u2019a kadar her g\xFCne bir g\xFCn olmak \xFCzere kaza edilir. Ard\u0131\u015F\u0131k olmalar\u0131 gerekmez ve y\u0131l i\xE7ine yay\u0131labilirler \u2014 ama onlar bir bor\xE7tur, bu y\xFCzden \xE7o\u011Fu kad\u0131n s\xFCregelen bir say\u0131m tutar. Bu alan o g\xFCnleri sizin i\xE7in kaydeder ve kapatt\u0131k\xE7a hesab\u0131 do\u011Fru tutar.",
  "Days owed": "Borcunuz olan g\xFCn",
