  "Details differ between legal schools; follow the imam and seek local scholarly guidance.": "Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar mezhepler aras\u0131nda de\u011Fi\u015Fir; imama uyun ve yerel \xE2limlerin rehberli\u011Fine ba\u015Fvurun.",
