  "Measured as it sits on the device, not as it arrived. Text is compressed on the way in and not once stored, so a translation that downloads as 3 MB takes 11 MB here.": "Geldi\u011Fi gibi de\u011Fil, cihazda durdu\u011Fu gibi \xF6l\xE7\xFCl\xFCr. Metin gelirken s\u0131k\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r, saklan\u0131rken s\u0131k\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lmaz; bu y\xFCzden 3 MB inen bir meal burada 11 MB yer kaplar.",
