  "Memorize Quran": "Kur'an Ezberle",
  "Men shave the head or trim the hair all over; a shave is preferable. Women cut a fingertip\u2019s length from the ends of the hair. With this, the Umrah is complete and everything Ihram had forbidden becomes lawful again.": "Erkekler ba\u015F\u0131 t\u0131ra\u015F eder veya sa\xE7\u0131n tamam\u0131n\u0131 k\u0131salt\u0131r; t\u0131ra\u015F daha faziletlidir. Kad\u0131nlar sa\xE7\u0131n u\xE7lar\u0131ndan bir parmak ucu kadar keser. Bununla Umre tamamlan\u0131r ve ihram\u0131n yasaklad\u0131\u011F\u0131 her \u015Fey yeniden helal olur.",
  "Meningitis ACWY vaccination certificate \u2014 required for every pilgrim": "Meninjit ACWY a\u015F\u0131 sertifikas\u0131 \u2014 her hac\u0131 i\xE7in zorunlu",
