  "Name": "\u0130sim",
  "Names": "\u0130simler",
  'Narrated Anas bin Malik:The Prophet (\uFDFA) said, "Take Suhur as there is a blessing in it': "Enes bin M\xE2lik rivayet etti: Peygamber \uFDFA \u015F\xF6yle buyurdu: \u201CSahur yap\u0131n, \xE7\xFCnk\xFC onda bereket vard\u0131r\u201D",
  'Narrated Talha bin `Abdullah bin `Auf:I offered the funeral prayer behind Ibn `Abbas and he recited Al-Fatiha and said, "You should know that it (i.e. recitation of Al-Fatiha) is the tradition of the Prophet Muhammad (\uFDFA)': "Talha bin Abdullah bin Avf rivayet etti: \u0130bn Abbas\u2019\u0131n arkas\u0131nda cenaze namaz\u0131 k\u0131ld\u0131m, Fatiha\u2019y\u0131 okudu ve \u015F\xF6yle dedi: \u201CBilin ki bu (Fatiha\u2019y\u0131 okumak) Peygamber Muhammed \uFDFA\u2019in s\xFCnnetidir\u201D",
  "Narrator": "R\xE2vi",
  "Naskh": "Nesih",
  "Natural bleeding that comes to a woman at its known time, without a cause such as injury or illness. Commonly cited limits are a minimum of three days and a maximum of fifteen, with at least fifteen days of purity between two cycles. Anything outside that pattern is usually treated as istihadha, and the details belong with a scholar.": "Yaralanma veya hastal\u0131k gibi bir sebep olmaks\u0131z\u0131n, bilinen vaktinde bir kad\u0131na gelen tabii kanama. Yayg\u0131n olarak zikredilen s\u0131n\u0131rlar en az \xFC\xE7, en \xE7ok on be\u015F g\xFCn ve iki d\xF6ng\xFC aras\u0131nda en az on be\u015F g\xFCn temizliktir. Bu \xF6r\xFCnt\xFCn\xFCn d\u0131\u015F\u0131ndaki her \u015Fey genellikle istihaza say\u0131l\u0131r ve ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar bir \xE2lime aittir.",
  "Nawaytu raf\u2018 al-hadath al-akbar": "Neveyt\xFC ref\u2018a\u2019l-hadesi\u2019l-ekber",
  "Nawaytu raf\u2018 al-hadath al-akbar \u2014 I intend to lift the major impurity.": "Neveyt\xFC ref\u2018a\u2019l-hadesi\u2019l-ekber \u2014 b\xFCy\xFCk hadesi kald\u0131rmaya niyet ettim.",
  "Network request failed": "A\u011F iste\u011Fi ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z",
