  "No mail app was found. The report is saved in Settings and you can send it from there.": "Posta uygulamas\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Rapor Ayarlar'a kaydedilir ve oradan g\xF6nderebilirsiniz.",
  "No match in the offline list": "\xC7evrimd\u0131\u015F\u0131 listede e\u015Fle\u015Fme yok",
  "No match in what is on this device. Search only covers books you have opened or downloaded.": "Bu cihazdakiler aras\u0131nda e\u015Fle\u015Fme yok. Arama yaln\u0131zca a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z veya indirdi\u011Finiz kitaplar\u0131 kapsar.",
