  "No sign-up": "Kay\u0131t gerekmez",
  "No special garment \u2014 modest, loose clothing you can walk in": "\xD6zel bir giysi yok \u2014 i\xE7inde y\xFCr\xFCyebilece\u011Finiz, \xF6l\xE7\xFCl\xFC ve bol giysiler",
  "No surah matches that.": "Bununla e\u015Fle\u015Fen bir sure yok.",
  "No transliteration for this verse in this script.": "Bu ayet i\xE7in bu yaz\u0131da okunu\u015F yok.",
  "No words match. Try another search, or another group.": "E\u015Fle\u015Fen kelime yok. Ba\u015Fka bir arama veya ba\u015Fka bir grup deneyin.",
  "Normal text": "Normal metin",
