  "Not available": "Kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor",
  "Not downloaded": "\u0130ndirilmedi",
  "Not enough history yet to project from.": "\xD6ng\xF6r\xFC yapmak i\xE7in hen\xFCz yeterli ge\xE7mi\u015F yok.",
  "Not enrolled on this device yet": "Bu cihazda hen\xFCz kay\u0131tl\u0131 de\u011Fil",
  "Not in the list? Add it by coordinates below.": "Listede yok mu? A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da koordinatlar\u0131yla ekleyin.",
  "Not in the offline list, and the connection could not be reached. Continue and set it in Settings, where coordinates can be entered by hand.": "\xC7evrimd\u0131\u015F\u0131 listede yok ve ba\u011Flant\u0131ya ula\u015F\u0131lamad\u0131. Devam edin ve Ayarlar'dan belirleyin; orada koordinatlar elle girilebilir.",
  "Not notes on a verse \u2014 those live beside the ayah they belong to. This is only for you and the day you are in. Nothing is shared, and there is no streak to keep.": "Bir ayetin notu de\u011Fil \u2014 onlar ait olduklar\u0131 ayetin yan\u0131nda durur. Bu yaln\u0131zca sizin ve i\xE7inde bulundu\u011Funuz g\xFCn\xFCn i\xE7indir. Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey payla\u015F\u0131lmaz ve s\xFCrd\xFCr\xFClecek bir seri yoktur.",
  "Not recorded": "Kaydedilmedi",
  "Not sent yet": "Hen\xFCz g\xF6nderilmedi",
  "Not settled by the numbers alone": "Yaln\u0131zca say\u0131larla belirlenmez",
