  "Open the audio player": "Ses oynat\u0131c\u0131y\u0131 a\xE7",
  "Open the full reflection": "Tefekk\xFCr\xFCn tamam\u0131n\u0131 a\xE7",
  "Open the prophets catalogue": "Peygamberler katalo\u011Funu a\xE7",
  "Open this page by choosing an item from the list before it.": "Bu sayfay\u0131, \xF6ncesindeki listeden bir \xF6\u011Fe se\xE7erek a\xE7\u0131n.",
  "Open to you": "Size a\xE7\u0131k",
  "Open to you without question \u2014 no school disputes it. Put a reciter on and let the day be filled with the sound of it. Listening is not a lesser substitute for reciting; it is its own worship, and these are often the days a woman listens most.": "Size sorgusuz a\xE7\u0131k \u2014 hi\xE7bir mezhep buna itiraz etmez. Bir okuyucu a\xE7\u0131n ve g\xFCn onun sesiyle dolsun. Dinlemek, okuman\u0131n daha a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131 bir ikamesi de\u011Fildir; kendine ait bir ibadettir ve bunlar \xE7o\u011Fu zaman bir kad\u0131n\u0131n en \xE7ok dinledi\u011Fi g\xFCnlerdir.",
  "Open verse actions to add a reflection.": "Bir tefekk\xFCr eklemek i\xE7in ayet i\u015Flemlerini a\xE7\u0131n.",
  "Opening\u2026": "A\xE7\u0131l\u0131yor\u2026",
  "Opens a screen": "Bir ekran a\xE7ar",
  "Optional": "\u0130ste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131",
  "Optional \u2014 anything that helps us find it.": "\u0130ste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131 \u2014 bulmam\u0131za yard\u0131mc\u0131 olabilecek herhangi bir \u015Fey.",
  "Optional. Nothing is downloaded until you finish setting up.": "\u0130ste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131. Kurulumu bitirmeden hi\xE7bir \u015Fey indirilmez.",
  "Or an unscented anti-chafe balm in a stick": "Ya da \xE7ubuk halinde kokusuz s\xFCrt\xFCnme \xF6nleyici balsam",
  "Or enter coordinates": "Veya koordinat girin",
  "Or paste one instead": "Veya onun yerine yap\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n",
