  "Part of the verse is blanked, the rest guides you.": "Ayetin bir k\u0131sm\u0131 bo\u015Falt\u0131l\u0131r, gerisi size yol g\xF6sterir.",
  "Partly translated": "K\u0131smen \xE7evrildi",
  "Partly translated \u2014 some screens stay in English": "K\u0131smen \xE7evrildi \u2014 baz\u0131 ekranlar \u0130ngilizce kal\u0131r",
  "Passages inviting reflection on creation, order and purpose.": "Yarat\u0131l\u0131\u015F, d\xFCzen ve gaye \xFCzerinde tefekk\xFCre \xE7a\u011F\u0131ran b\xF6l\xFCmler.",
  "Passport with at least six months left on it": "En az alt\u0131 ay ge\xE7erlili\u011Fi kalan pasaport",
  "Password": "\u015Eifre",
  "Password changed. Backups already made still open with the old one.": "\u015Eifre de\u011Fi\u015Ftirildi. \xD6nceden olu\u015Fturulan yedekler eskisiyle a\xE7\u0131lmaya devam eder.",
  "Password removed. Backups already made still open with it.": "\u015Eifre kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131. \xD6nceden olu\u015Fturulan yedekler onunla a\xE7\u0131lmaya devam eder.",
  "Password set. Nothing can recover it \u2014 not this app, and not anyone else.": "\u015Eifre belirlendi. Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey onu geri getiremez \u2014 ne bu uygulama ne de ba\u015Fka biri.",
  "Past forty days \u2014 speak to a scholar and a doctor": "K\u0131rk g\xFCn\xFC ge\xE7ti \u2014 bir \xE2lime ve bir doktora dan\u0131\u015F\u0131n",
  "Past that limit the extra days are treated as istihada rather than as nifas.": "O s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n \xF6tesindeki fazla g\xFCnler nifas de\u011Fil istihaza say\u0131l\u0131r.",
  "Paste the whole backup file here": "Yedek dosyas\u0131n\u0131n tamam\u0131n\u0131 buraya yap\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n",
