  "Per-prayer reminders": "Namaz ba\u015F\u0131na hat\u0131rlatmalar",
  "Perform a complete wudu, as for prayer.": "Namazdaki gibi tam bir abdest al\u0131n.",
  "Perform ghusl and wear clean clothing.": "Gus\xFCl abdesti al\u0131n ve temiz giysiler giyin.",
  "Perform two prostrations with a seated pause.": "Oturakl\u0131 bir arayla iki secde yap\u0131n.",
  "Perform wudu in full \u2014 the Prophet \uFDFA performed wudu before the ghusl.": "Tam bir abdest al\u0131n \u2014 Peygamber \uFDFA gus\xFClden \xF6nce abdest al\u0131rd\u0131.",
  "Period logging and predictions": "D\xF6ng\xFC kayd\u0131 ve tahminler",
  "Permission": "\u0130zin",
  "Permission and scheduling happen on your device. No notification profile is sent to us.": "\u0130zin ve planlama cihaz\u0131n\u0131zda ger\xE7ekle\u015Fir. Bize hi\xE7bir bildirim profili g\xF6nderilmez.",
  "Permission was declined earlier, so reminders stay off. You can turn them on in the system settings for this app at any time.": "\u0130zin daha \xF6nce reddedildi, bu y\xFCzden hat\u0131rlatmalar kapal\u0131 kal\u0131r. \u0130stedi\u011Finiz zaman bu uygulaman\u0131n sistem ayarlar\u0131ndan a\xE7abilirsiniz.",
  "Permission: unsupported": "\u0130zin: desteklenmiyor",
