  "Post-natal": "Do\u011Fum sonras\u0131",
  "Post-natal bleeding is open, so bleeding in these days is counted as nifas and not as hayd.": "Do\u011Fum sonras\u0131 kanama d\xF6nemi a\xE7\u0131k, bu y\xFCzden bu g\xFCnlerdeki kanama hay\u0131z de\u011Fil nifas say\u0131l\u0131r.",
  "Post-natal \xB7 day {n}": "Do\u011Fum sonras\u0131 \xB7 {n}. g\xFCn",
  "Pound Sterling": "\u0130ngiliz Sterlini",
  "Pour water over the head three times, so it reaches the roots of the hair.": "Sa\xE7\u0131n diplerine ula\u015Facak \u015Fekilde ba\u015Fa \xFC\xE7 kez su d\xF6k\xFCn.",
  "Pour water over the whole body, right side first, making sure no patch of skin is left dry.": "\xD6nce sa\u011F taraf olmak \xFCzere t\xFCm v\xFCcuda su d\xF6k\xFCn ve hi\xE7bir yerin kuru kalmad\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan emin olun.",
  "Power and connectivity": "G\xFC\xE7 ve ba\u011Flant\u0131",
  "Power bank, carried in hand luggage": "El bagaj\u0131nda ta\u015F\u0131nan ta\u015F\u0131nabilir \u015Farj cihaz\u0131",
  "Practical tools": "Pratik ara\xE7lar",
  "Practice memorized Surahs": "Ezberlenen sureleri tekrar et",
  "Practise": "\xC7al\u0131\u015F",
  "Practised": "\xC7al\u0131\u015F\u0131ld\u0131",
  "Praise, fills the scale": "Hamd, mizan\u0131 doldurur",
  "Pray after Isha, individually or with the congregation.": "Yats\u0131dan sonra tek ba\u015F\u0131n\u0131za veya cemaatle namaz k\u0131l\u0131n.",
  "Pray in sets of two rakahs.": "\u0130ki\u015Fer rek\xE2t halinde namaz k\u0131l\u0131n.",
  "Pray two non-obligatory rakahs.": "\u0130ki nafile rek\xE2t namaz k\u0131l\u0131n.",
  "Pray two rak\u2018ahs and give thanks": "\u0130ki rek\xE2t namaz k\u0131l\u0131n ve \u015F\xFCkredin",
  "Pray where you can in the Haram, give charity if you are able, and keep the supplication that is offered after a completed rite. Many then repeat the Umrah from Al-Tan\u2018\u012Bm or perform it again for someone else \u2014 that is a matter of your own intention and capacity.": "Harem\u2019de elinizden geldi\u011Fince namaz k\u0131l\u0131n, g\xFCc\xFCn\xFCz yetiyorsa sadaka verin ve tamamlanm\u0131\u015F bir menasikten sonra yap\u0131lan duay\u0131 s\xFCrd\xFCr\xFCn. Pek \xE7o\u011Fu sonra Tenf\xEEm\u2019den Umre\u2019yi tekrarlar veya bir ba\u015Fkas\u0131 ad\u0131na yeniden yapar \u2014 bu sizin kendi niyetinize ve g\xFCc\xFCn\xFCze kalm\u0131\u015F bir i\u015Ftir.",
  "Prayer": "Namaz",
  "Prayer Reminders": "Namaz Hat\u0131rlatmalar\u0131",
  "Prayer and fasting are due": "Namaz ve oru\xE7 gereklidir",
  "Prayer and fasting are not due in these days": "Bu g\xFCnlerde namaz ve oru\xE7 gerekmez",
  "Prayer and fasting are not due while it continues, and the fasts are owed.": "S\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFC m\xFCddet\xE7e namaz ve oru\xE7 gerekmez ve oru\xE7lar bor\xE7tur.",
  "Prayer and fasting resume from here": "Namaz ve oru\xE7 buradan itibaren yeniden ba\u015Flar",
  "Prayer and fasting resume from here, and a fast kept after the ghusl counts.": "Namaz ve oru\xE7 buradan itibaren ba\u015Flar ve gus\xFClden sonra tutulan oru\xE7 ge\xE7erlidir.",
  "Prayer and fasting resume from here, and the fasts of these days count.": "Namaz ve oru\xE7 buradan itibaren ba\u015Flar ve bu g\xFCnlerin oru\xE7lar\u0131 ge\xE7erlidir.",
  "Prayer during the monthly cycle": "Ayl\u0131k d\xF6ng\xFCde namaz",
  "Prayer is due in these days, and the prayer of each one is prayed.": "Bu g\xFCnlerde namaz gerekir ve her birinin namaz\u0131 k\u0131l\u0131n\u0131r.",
  "Prayer record, reading position, bookmarks, notes, settings, chosen city and language. Removed by clearing storage or uninstalling.": "Namaz kayd\u0131, okuma konumu, yer imleri, notlar, ayarlar, se\xE7ilen \u015Fehir ve dil. Depolama alan\u0131n\u0131 temizleyerek veya uygulamay\u0131 kald\u0131rarak silinir.",
  "Prayer reminders": "Namaz hat\u0131rlatmalar\u0131",
  "Prayer reminders are ready": "Namaz hat\u0131rlat\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 haz\u0131r",
  "Prayer schedule": "Namaz vakitleri",
  "Prayer spaces around you": "\xC7evrenizdeki namaz yerleri",
  "Prayer times": "Namaz vakitleri",
  "Prayer times, Qibla and fasting times read from one place. Tap to choose a city or enter coordinates.": "Namaz vakitleri, k\u0131ble ve oru\xE7 vakitleri tek bir yerden okunur. \u015Eehir se\xE7mek veya koordinat girmek i\xE7in dokunun.",
  "Prayer times, Qibla and the fasting timetable all read from one place. Search for your city, or use your location once. This is asked only here \u2014 you can change it any time in Settings.": "Namaz vakitleri, k\u0131ble ve oru\xE7 takviminin hepsi tek bir yerden okunur. \u015Eehrinizi aray\u0131n veya konumunuzu bir kez kullan\u0131n. Bu yaln\u0131zca burada sorulur \u2014 Ayarlar'dan istedi\u011Finiz zaman de\u011Fi\u015Ftirebilirsiniz.",
  "Prayer times, Qibla, Ramadan and nearby mosques all read from this one place. It is asked once and kept on this device.": "Namaz vakitleri, k\u0131ble, Ramazan ve yak\u0131ndaki camilerin hepsi tek bir yerden okunur. Bir kez sorulur ve bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.",
  "Prayer times, the Hijri date, the Ramadan timetable, and the 604-page Mushaf layout with the Juz and Hizb divisions \u2014 kept with the app rather than asked for, so a page of the Quran opens without a connection. Every adhan recording is stored here too, eighteen for the day and two for dawn, which is what lets the call sound at Fajr with no network at all. The sun does not need the internet, and nothing about where you are is sent anywhere.": "Namaz vakitleri, hicri tarih, Ramazan takvimi ve c\xFCz ile hizp b\xF6l\xFCmleriyle 604 sayfal\u0131k Mushaf d\xFCzeni \u2014 istenmek yerine uygulama birlikte tutulur, b\xF6ylece bir Kur'an sayfas\u0131 ba\u011Flant\u0131 olmadan a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r. Her ezan kayd\u0131 da burada saklan\u0131r: g\xFCn i\xE7in on sekiz, \u015Fafak i\xE7in iki; \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131n\u0131n hi\xE7 a\u011F yokken sabah namaz\u0131nda duyulmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flayan budur. G\xFCne\u015Fin internete ihtiyac\u0131 yoktur ve nerede oldu\u011Funuza dair hi\xE7bir \u015Fey hi\xE7bir yere g\xF6nderilmez.",
  "Prayer tools": "Namaz ara\xE7lar\u0131",
  "Prayer, Qibla, Ramadan, and mosque tools share this saved location. It stays on this device.": "Namaz, k\u0131ble, Ramazan ve cami ara\xE7lar\u0131 bu kay\u0131tl\u0131 konumu payla\u015F\u0131r. Bu cihazda kal\u0131r.",
