  "Preview a recording and choose which prayers may use Adhan. The bundled selection works without a network connection.": "Bir kayd\u0131 \xF6nizleyin ve hangi namazlar\u0131n ezan kullanabilece\u011Fini se\xE7in. Paketli se\xE7im a\u011F ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131 olmadan \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r.",
