  "Quran 2:222 \u2014 \u201CAnd they ask you about menstruation\u2026\u201D": "Kur\u2019an 2:222 \u2014 \u201CSana \xE2det h\xE2linden soruyorlar\u2026\u201D",
  "Quran Audio": "Kur\u2019an Sesi",
  "Quran TV and Sunnah TV play right here, from the broadcaster\u2019s own stream. The other channels open outside this app, because carrying them here would need rights the app does not hold.": "Quran TV ve Sunnah TV, yay\u0131nc\u0131n\u0131n kendi ak\u0131\u015F\u0131ndan do\u011Frudan burada \xE7alar. Di\u011Fer kanallar bu uygulaman\u0131n d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r, \xE7\xFCnk\xFC onlar\u0131 buraya ta\u015F\u0131mak uygulaman\u0131n sahip olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 haklar\u0131 gerektirir.",
