  "Quran notes": "Kur'an notlar\u0131",
  "Quran preparation stopped because live data could not be reached.": "Canl\u0131 veriye ula\u015F\u0131lamad\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in Kur\u2019an haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131 durdu.",
