  "Quran study tools": "Kur\u2019an \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma ara\xE7lar\u0131",
  "Quran text, hadith, the Names and the supplications come from the sources named in the app. Rulings and guidance are summarised for learning; for a matter that affects your worship or your obligations, ask a qualified scholar. This app is not a source of legal or religious authority.": "Kur'an metni, hadis, \u0130simler ve dualar uygulamada ad\u0131 ge\xE7en kaynaklardan gelir. H\xFCk\xFCmler ve rehberlik \xF6\u011Frenim amac\u0131yla \xF6zetlenmi\u015Ftir; ibadetinizi veya y\xFCk\xFCml\xFCl\xFCklerinizi etkileyen bir konuda yetkin bir \xE2lime dan\u0131\u015F\u0131n. Bu uygulama hukuki veya dini bir otorite kayna\u011F\u0131 de\u011Fildir.",
  "Quran text, prayer times, hadith, the Names, supplications and the countdown to Hajj come from api.islamicdata.uz. Recitation audio comes from cdn.islamic.network. The adhan recordings you choose are downloaded from audio.islamicdata.uz. Gold and silver prices used by the Zakat calculator come from misc.islamicdata.uz. Each of these receives the request needed to answer it and nothing about you.": "Kur'an metni, namaz vakitleri, hadis, \u0130simler, dualar ve Hac geri say\u0131m\u0131 api.islamicdata.uz adresinden gelir. Tilavet sesi cdn.islamicnetwork'den gelir. Se\xE7ti\u011Finiz ezan kay\u0131tlar\u0131 audio.islamicdata.uz adresinden indirilir. Zek\xE2t hesaplay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n kulland\u0131\u011F\u0131 alt\u0131n ve g\xFCm\xFC\u015F fiyatlar\u0131 misc.islamicdata.uz adresinden gelir. Her biri yaln\u0131zca yan\u0131tlamak i\xE7in gereken iste\u011Fi al\u0131r, sizinle ilgili hi\xE7bir \u015Feyi almaz.",
