  "Record the days as they come. The averages and the prediction are worked out from your own history \u2014 nothing is assumed about what your cycle should look like.": "G\xFCnleri geldik\xE7e kaydedin. Ortalamalar ve tahmin kendi ge\xE7mi\u015Finizden \xE7\u0131kar\u0131l\u0131r \u2014 d\xF6ng\xFCn\xFCz\xFCn nas\u0131l olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011Fi hakk\u0131nda hi\xE7bir varsay\u0131m yoktur.",
