  "Return to Makkah for Tawaf al-If\u0101dah, seven circuits, followed by the Sa\u2018i if you have not already performed it for the Hajj. This Tawaf is the essential pillar: the Hajj is not complete without it.": "Tavaf-\u0131 \u0130fada i\xE7in Mekke\u2019ye d\xF6n\xFCn, yedi \u015Favt, ard\u0131ndan Hac i\xE7in hen\xFCz yapmad\u0131ysan\u0131z sa\u2018y gelir. Bu tavaf as\u0131l r\xFCk\xFCnd\xFCr: Hac onun olmadan tamamlanmaz.",
