  "Sahih Muslim \u2014 the hadith of Umm Atiyya on the signs of purity": "Sahih-i M\xFCslim \u2014 \xDCmm\xFC Atiyye\u2019nin temizlik i\u015Faretleri hakk\u0131ndaki hadisi",
  "Sahih al-Bukhari and Muslim \u2014 \u201CDo what the pilgrim does, except do not circumambulate the House\u201D": "Sahih-i Buh\xE2r\xEE ve M\xFCslim \u2014 \u201CHacceden ki\u015Finin yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 yap, ancak Beyt\u2019i tavaf etme\u201D",
  "Sahih al-Bukhari, Kitab al-Hayd \u2014 the hadith of Aisha on making up fasts, not prayers": "Sahih-i Buh\xE2r\xEE, Kit\xE2b\xFC\u2019l-Hayz \u2014 Ai\u015Fe\u2019nin namazlar\u0131 de\u011Fil oru\xE7lar\u0131 kaza etmeye dair hadisi",
  "Said for": "\u015Eunun i\xE7in s\xF6ylenir",
  "Salah Tracker": "Namaz takibi",
  "Salah counts the prayers you mark on the Prayer screen. Reading counts the verses you mark in the reader and the Mushaf pages you open. Dhikr comes from the Tasbih counter, and hifz from every verse you rate in recall practice. The week is kept on this device only.": "Namaz, Namaz ekran\u0131nda i\u015Faretledi\u011Finiz namazlar\u0131 sayar. Okuma, okuyucuda i\u015Faretledi\u011Finiz ayetleri ve a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z Mushaf sayfalar\u0131n\u0131 sayar. Zikir tesbih sayac\u0131ndan, h\u0131fz ise hat\u0131rlama al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rmas\u0131nda derecelendirdi\u011Finiz her ayetten gelir. Hafta yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda tutulur.",
  "Salah counts the prayers you mark on the Prayer screen. Reading counts the verses you mark in the reader and the Mushaf pages you open. Dhikr comes from the Tasbih counter, and hifz from every verse you rate in recall practice. Thirty days are kept, on this device only, and nothing is uploaded.": "Namaz, Namaz ekran\u0131nda i\u015Faretledi\u011Finiz namazlar\u0131 sayar. Okuma, okuyucuda i\u015Faretledi\u011Finiz ayetleri ve a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z Mushaf sayfalar\u0131n\u0131 sayar. Zikir tesbih sayac\u0131ndan, h\u0131fz ise hat\u0131rlama \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131nda de\u011Ferlendirdi\u011Finiz her ayetten gelir. Otuz g\xFCn tutulur, yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda ve hi\xE7bir \u015Fey y\xFCklenmez.",
  "Salat al-Janazah is a communal obligation and is performed standing, without bowing or prostration.": "Cenaze namaz\u0131 farz-\u0131 kifayedir ve r\xFCk\xFBsuz, secdesiz, ayakta k\u0131l\u0131n\u0131r.",
