  "Scheherazade": "Scheherazade",
  "Scheherazade New": "Scheherazade New",
  "Scholars differ on which of the two to measure against. The lower threshold brings more wealth into Zakat; take the choice to someone you trust.": "\xC2limler ikisinden hangisine g\xF6re \xF6l\xE7\xFClece\u011Fi konusunda ayr\u0131\u015F\u0131r. Daha d\xFC\u015F\xFCk e\u015Fik daha \xE7ok mal\u0131 zek\xE2ta dahil eder; se\xE7imi g\xFCvendi\u011Finiz birine g\xF6t\xFCr\xFCn.",
  "Scholars differ. Reciting from memory is widely permitted; touching the physical mushaf is not, since it requires purification. On screens and phones the question turns on whether a device counts as a mushaf \u2014 many contemporary scholars permit reading and reciting from a phone for that reason, while others advise limiting it to looking and listening. Follow the position of a scholar you trust, and keep the Quran close either way: listening to recitation is open to everyone, in every state.": "\xC2limler bu konuda ayr\u0131l\u0131r. Ezberden okumak geni\u015F \xF6l\xE7\xFCde caiz g\xF6r\xFCl\xFCr; fizik\xEE mushafa dokunmak ise temizlik gerektirdi\u011Fi i\xE7in caiz de\u011Fildir. Ekranlarda ve telefonlarda mesele, bir cihaz\u0131n mushaf say\u0131l\u0131p say\u0131lmayaca\u011F\u0131na d\xF6ner \u2014 bir\xE7ok \xE7a\u011Fda\u015F \xE2lim bu sebeple telefondan okumay\u0131 ve tilaveti caiz g\xF6r\xFCr, baz\u0131lar\u0131 ise bakmak ve dinlemekle s\u0131n\u0131rlamay\u0131 \xF6\u011F\xFCtler. G\xFCvendi\u011Finiz bir \xE2limin g\xF6r\xFC\u015F\xFCne uyun ve her iki halde de Kur\u2019an\u2019\u0131 yak\u0131n tutun: tilaveti dinlemek herkese, her halde a\xE7\u0131kt\u0131r.",
  "Script": "Yaz\u0131",
