  "Translation": "Meal",
  "Translation Compare": "Meal Kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rma",
  "Translation and tafsir are not the Quran in the sense that recitation is \u2014 they are the study of it, and study is not closed to you. Many women find these days become the most attentive reading of their month, precisely because the pace slows and the hurry goes out of it.": "Meal ve tefsir, tilavetin oldu\u011Fu anlamda Kur\u2019an de\u011Fildir \u2014 onlar Kur\u2019an \xFCzerine \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmad\u0131r ve \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma size kapal\u0131 de\u011Fildir. Pek \xE7ok kad\u0131n bu g\xFCnlerin ay\u0131ndaki en dikkatli okumas\u0131 h\xE2line geldi\u011Fini g\xF6r\xFCr, tam da tempo yava\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131 ve acele \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in.",
  "Translation audio": "Meal sesi",
  "Translation volume": "Meal sesi",
  "Translations": "Mealler",
  "Translations explain meaning and do not replace the Arabic Quran. Edition attribution remains visible in the reader.": "Mealler anlam\u0131 a\xE7\u0131klar ve Arap\xE7a Kur'an'\u0131n yerini tutmaz. Bask\u0131 atf\u0131 okuyucuda g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr kal\u0131r.",
