  "Two cycles needed": "\u0130ki d\xF6ng\xFC gerekiyor",
  "Two notifications sent \u2014 one quiet, one adhan.": "\u0130ki bildirim g\xF6nderildi \u2014 biri sessiz, biri ezan.",
  "Two or three interchangeable abayas \u2014 laundries wash same-day and cheaply": "\u0130ki veya \xFC\xE7 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilebilir abaye \u2014 \xE7ama\u015F\u0131rhaneler ayn\u0131 g\xFCn ve ucuza y\u0131kar",
  "Two sets, not one \u2014 a wet set and a dry set": "\u0130ki tak\u0131m, bir de\u011Fil \u2014 bir \u0131slak tak\u0131m ve bir kuru tak\u0131m",
  "Two worships are lifted in these days \u2014 the prayer and the fast \u2014 and they are lifted as a mercy, not held back as a loss. Nearly everything else you do is untouched by them: the remembrance, the listening, the study, the asking. All of it is still yours, and all of it is already here.": "Bu g\xFCnlerde iki ibadet kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r \u2014 namaz ve oru\xE7 \u2014 ve bunlar bir kay\u0131p olarak esirgenmek de\u011Fil, bir rahmet olarak kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r. Yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z neredeyse her \u015Fey onlardan etkilenmez: zikir, dinleme, \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma, dua. Hepsi h\xE2l\xE2 sizindir ve hepsi zaten buradad\u0131r.",
  "Two worships are lifted in these days, and they are lifted as a mercy rather than taken as a loss. Nothing here is owed back, and nothing needs to be made up except the fasts. Where the scholars differ, the difference is described rather than settled \u2014 take it to someone you trust, and do not let it become a weight. This app records and explains; it does not rule.": "Bu g\xFCnlerde iki ibadet kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r ve bu bir kay\u0131p olarak de\u011Fil, bir rahmet olarak kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r. Burada geri istenen bir \u015Fey yoktur ve oru\xE7lar d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda kaza edilecek bir \u015Fey yoktur. \xC2limlerin ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131 yerde ayr\u0131l\u0131k ba\u011Flanmaz, anlat\u0131l\u0131r \u2014 g\xFCvendi\u011Finiz birine g\xF6t\xFCr\xFCn ve onun bir y\xFCk h\xE2line gelmesine izin vermeyin. Bu uygulama kaydeder ve a\xE7\u0131klar; h\xFCk\xFCm vermez.",
