  "Verse-by-verse files, one track per ayah, with translation audio and reader controls.": "Ayet ayet dosyalar, her ayet i\xE7in bir par\xE7a, meal sesi ve okuyucu denetimleriyle.",
  "Verse-by-verse: one track for each ayah. Full-Surah: a complete recitation of the Surah.": "Ayet ayet: her ayet i\xE7in bir par\xE7a. T\xFCm sure: surenin eksiksiz bir tilaveti.",
  "Verses": "Ayetler",
  "Verses affirming the absolute oneness, independence and incomparability of Allah.": "Allah\u2019\u0131n mutlak birli\u011Fini, hi\xE7bir \u015Feye muhta\xE7 olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve benzersizli\u011Fini dile getiren ayetler.",
  "Verses under this are drawn more often. Anything you flag yourself counts as weak whatever it scores.": "Bunun alt\u0131ndaki ayetler daha s\u0131k \xE7ekilir. Kendiniz i\u015Faretledi\u011Finiz her \u015Fey, puan\u0131 ne olursa olsun zay\u0131f say\u0131l\u0131r.",
