  "Your pattern": "D\xFCzeniniz",
  "Your pattern is steady, so this should be close.": "D\xFCzeniniz sabit, bu y\xFCzden bu yak\u0131n olmal\u0131.",
  "Your position": "Konumunuz",
  "Your prayer record, the surah and verse you last read, bookmarks, notes, reminder settings, the language you chose and the city you picked are stored on the device itself. Clearing the app\u2019s storage or uninstalling removes them.": "Namaz kayd\u0131n\u0131z, en son okudu\u011Funuz sure ve ayet, yer imleri, notlar, hat\u0131rlatma ayarlar\u0131, se\xE7ti\u011Finiz dil ve se\xE7ti\u011Finiz \u015Fehir cihaz\u0131n kendisinde saklan\u0131r. Uygulaman\u0131n depolama alan\u0131n\u0131 temizlemek veya uygulamay\u0131 kald\u0131rmak bunlar\u0131 siler.",
  "Your recorded pattern: about {n} days.": "Kay\u0131tl\u0131 d\xFCzeniniz: yakla\u015F\u0131k {n} g\xFCn.",
  "Your week in review": "Haftan\u0131z\u0131n de\u011Ferlendirmesi",
  "Your worship stays private and your preferences remain on this device.": "\u0130badetiniz \xF6zel kal\u0131r ve tercihleriniz bu cihazda durur.",
  "Your worship, memorisation, notes, fasting and Qada are sealed with a password you choose. The password is never written down and cannot be recovered \u2014 not by this app, and not by anyone else.": "\u0130badetiniz, ezberiniz, notlar\u0131n\u0131z, orucunuz ve kazan\u0131z se\xE7ti\u011Finiz bir \u015Fifreyle m\xFCh\xFCrlenir. \u015Eifre hi\xE7bir yere yaz\u0131lmaz ve kurtar\u0131lamaz \u2014 ne bu uygulama taraf\u0131ndan ne de ba\u015Fka biri taraf\u0131ndan.",
  "ZAKAT DUE \xB7 2.5%": "\xD6DENECEK ZEK\xC2T \xB7 %2,5",
  "Zakat": "Zek\xE2t",
  "Zakat Calculator": "Zek\xE2t hesaplay\u0131c\u0131",
  "Zakat al-Fitr is due at the end of Ramadan for eligible Muslims and should reach recipients before Eid prayer.": "F\u0131t\u0131r sadakas\u0131, Ramazan\u2019\u0131n sonunda m\xFCkellef M\xFCsl\xFCmanlara vacip olur ve bayram namaz\u0131ndan \xF6nce al\u0131c\u0131lara ula\u015Fmal\u0131d\u0131r.",
  "Zakat is what is owed and has its own calculation. This is what you gave because you wanted to. Nothing here is sent anywhere.": "Zek\xE2t bor\xE7lu olunand\u0131r ve kendine ait bir hesab\u0131 vard\u0131r. Bu ise istedi\u011Finiz i\xE7in verdiklerinizdir. Buradaki hi\xE7bir \u015Fey hi\xE7bir yere g\xF6nderilmez.",
  "Zinc oxide cream for skin that is already raw \u2014 jelly prevents, zinc heals": "H\xE2lihaz\u0131rda tahri\u015F olmu\u015F cilt i\xE7in \xE7inko oksit krem \u2014 vazelin korur, \xE7inko iyile\u015Ftirir",
