  "Bathe and dress in the Ihram garments, then make the intention for the rites you have chosen and begin the Talbiyah. The prohibitions of Ihram now apply until you have stoned, sacrificed and shaved or trimmed.": "Mandilah dan kenakan pakaian ihram, lalu niatkan manasik yang Anda pilih dan mulailah talbiah. Larangan-larangan ihram kini berlaku sampai Anda melontar, berkurban, dan mencukur atau memendekkan rambut.",
  "Bathe, dress, intend, and begin the Talbiyah": "Mandi, berpakaian, berniat, dan mulailah talbiah",
