  "Fewer": "Lebih sedikit",
  "Files are written to a temporary partial file first, checked against the size the server reported, and only then moved into place. A failed download is deleted rather than left half-written.": "Berkas ditulis lebih dulu ke berkas sementara, diperiksa terhadap ukuran yang dilaporkan server, dan baru kemudian dipindahkan ke tempatnya. Unduhan yang gagal dihapus, bukan dibiarkan setengah tertulis.",
