  "Measured as it sits on the device, not as it arrived. Text is compressed on the way in and not once stored, so a translation that downloads as 3 MB takes 11 MB here.": "Diukur sebagaimana adanya di perangkat, bukan sebagaimana saat diunduh. Teks dikompresi saat masuk dan tidak disimpan dalam keadaan terkompresi, jadi terjemahan yang diunduh sebesar 3 MB memakan 11 MB di sini.",
