  "Names": "Nama-nama",
  'Narrated Anas bin Malik:The Prophet (\uFDFA) said, "Take Suhur as there is a blessing in it': "Diriwayatkan dari Anas bin Malik: Nabi \uFDFA bersabda, \xABMakan sahurlah kalian, karena dalam sahur itu ada berkah",
  'Narrated Talha bin `Abdullah bin `Auf:I offered the funeral prayer behind Ibn `Abbas and he recited Al-Fatiha and said, "You should know that it (i.e. recitation of Al-Fatiha) is the tradition of the Prophet Muhammad (\uFDFA)': "Diriwayatkan dari Talhah bin Abdullah bin Auf: Aku salat jenazah di belakang Ibnu Abbas, lalu ia membaca Al-Fatihah dan berkata, \xABKetahuilah bahwa ia (membaca Al-Fatihah) adalah sunnah Nabi Muhammad \uFDFA",
  "Narrator": "Periwayat",
  "Naskh": "Naskh",
  "Natural bleeding that comes to a woman at its known time, without a cause such as injury or illness. Commonly cited limits are a minimum of three days and a maximum of fifteen, with at least fifteen days of purity between two cycles. Anything outside that pattern is usually treated as istihadha, and the details belong with a scholar.": "Perdarahan alami yang datang kepada seorang perempuan pada waktu yang dikenalnya, tanpa sebab seperti luka atau penyakit. Batas yang lazim dikemukakan adalah paling sedikit tiga hari dan paling lama lima belas hari, dengan sedikitnya lima belas hari suci di antara dua siklus. Apa pun di luar pola itu biasanya diperlakukan sebagai istihadhah, dan rinciannya menjadi wewenang ulama.",
  "Nawaytu raf\u2018 al-hadath al-akbar": "Nawaitu rafal hadatsil akbar",
  "Nawaytu raf\u2018 al-hadath al-akbar \u2014 I intend to lift the major impurity.": "Nawaitu rafal hadatsil akbar \u2014 aku berniat mengangkat hadas besar.",
