  "Sahih al-Bukhari, Kitab al-Hayd \u2014 the hadith of Aisha on making up fasts, not prayers": "Sahih Bukhari, Kitab al-Haid \u2014 hadis Aisyah tentang mengganti puasa, bukan salat",
