  "Whether the app is felt as well as seen": "Apakah aplikasi juga terasa, bukan hanya terlihat",
  "Which call plays, and how it is announced": "Azan mana yang berbunyi, dan bagaimana ia diumumkan",
  "Which colours the app wears. Each theme has its own light and dark.": "Warna yang dikenakan aplikasi. Setiap tema memiliki terang dan gelapnya sendiri.",
  "Which fasts your cycle may claim, and when they fall due": "Puasa mana yang mungkin diklaim siklus Anda, dan kapan jatuh tempo",
