  "AND IF My servants ask thee about Me - behold, I am near; I respond to the call of him who calls, whenever he calls unto Me: let them, then, respond unto Me, and believe in Me, so that they might follow the right way.": "V\xC0 KHI c\xE1c b\u1EC1 t\xF4i c\u1EE7a TA h\u1ECFi Ng\u01B0\u01A1i v\u1EC1 TA \u2014 n\xE0y, TA \u1EDF g\u1EA7n; TA \u0111\xE1p l\u1EA1i l\u1EDDi k\xEAu g\u1ECDi c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\xEAu c\u1EA7u, b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 khi n\xE0o ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u1EA5y k\xEAu c\u1EA7u TA: v\u1EADy h\xE3y \u0111\u1EC3 h\u1ECD \u0111\xE1p l\u1EA1i TA, v\xE0 tin n\u01A1i TA, \u0111\u1EC3 h\u1ECD c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111i theo con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\xFAng \u0111\u1EAFn.",
