  "Adhan, a quiet reminder before each prayer, and a verse each morning. Every one of these can be switched off later, and nothing is scheduled until you allow it.": "Adhan, m\u1ED9t l\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFc \xEAm l\u1EB7ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1ED7i l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n, v\xE0 m\u1ED9t c\xE2u Kinh m\u1ED7i s\xE1ng. M\u1ED7i \u0111i\u1EC1u trong s\u1ED1 n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC1u c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EAFt \u0111i sau n\xE0y, v\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xEAn l\u1ECBch cho \u0111\u1EBFn khi b\u1EA1n cho ph\xE9p.",
  "Adhkar": "Adhkar",
