  "After salah": "Sau l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n",
  "After the first takbir, recite Al-Fatihah.": "Sau l\u1EDDi takbir th\u1EE9 nh\u1EA5t, h\xE3y \u0111\u1ECDc Al-Fatihah.",
  "After the fourth, pause briefly and conclude with salam.": "Sau l\u1EDDi takbir th\u1EE9 t\u01B0, h\xE3y d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt v\xE0 k\u1EBFt th\xFAc b\u1EB1ng salam.",
  "After the prayer": "Sau l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n",
