  "After the second, send blessings upon the Prophet \uFDFA.": "Sau l\u1EDDi takbir th\u1EE9 hai, h\xE3y g\u1EEDi l\u1EDDi ch\xFAc ph\xFAc \u0111\u1EBFn Thi\xEAn S\u1EE9 \uFDFA.",
  "After the third, supplicate sincerely for the deceased.": "Sau l\u1EDDi takbir th\u1EE9 ba, h\xE3y th\xE0nh t\xE2m c\u1EA7u xin cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 m\u1EA5t.",
  "Ahmed ibn Ali al-Ajamy": "Ahmed ibn Ali al-Ajamy",
