  "Amount of": "S\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng",
  "An encrypted copy of everything": "M\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n sao \u0111\xE3 m\xE3 h\xF3a c\u1EE7a m\u1ECDi th\u1EE9",
  "An encrypted copy, sealed with a password you choose": "M\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n sao \u0111\xE3 m\xE3 h\xF3a, \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ni\xEAm phong b\u1EB1ng m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u b\u1EA1n ch\u1ECDn",
  "An estimate, not a certainty": "M\u1ED9t \u01B0\u1EDBc t\xEDnh, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i \u0111i\u1EC1u ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn",
  "An obligatory prolongation, commonly four to five counts.": "M\u1ED9t s\u1EF1 k\xE9o d\xE0i b\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c, th\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xE0 b\u1ED1n \u0111\u1EBFn n\u0103m nh\u1ECBp.",
  "An open Naskh with generous, clear diacritics": "M\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n Naskh tho\xE1ng, v\u1EDBi c\xE1c d\u1EA5u ph\u1EE5 r\xF5 r\xE0ng",
  "And what could make thee conceive what it is, that Night of Destiny?": "V\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC c\xF3 th\u1EC3 khi\u1EBFn Ng\u01B0\u01A1i hi\u1EC3u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xF3 l\xE0 g\xEC, \u0110\xEAm \u0110\u1ECBnh M\u1EC7nh \u1EA5y?",
  "Android is not allowing this app to set exact alarms, so the adhan cannot be timed to the prayer. Your notification tone will sound instead. Allow alarms and it will play properly.": "Android kh\xF4ng cho ph\xE9p \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng n\xE0y \u0111\u1EB7t b\xE1o th\u1EE9c ch\xEDnh x\xE1c, n\xEAn Adhan kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c canh \u0111\xFAng gi\u1EDD l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n. Thay v\xE0o \u0111\xF3, \xE2m th\xF4ng b\xE1o c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD vang l\xEAn. H\xE3y cho ph\xE9p b\xE1o th\u1EE9c v\xE0 n\xF3 s\u1EBD ph\xE1t \u0111\xFAng.",
  "Android sometimes delays alarms for apps it thinks are idle, which can make the adhan arrive late. Exempting this app takes one tap.": "Android \u0111\xF4i khi tr\xEC ho\xE3n b\xE1o th\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a nh\u1EEFng \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng m\xE0 n\xF3 cho l\xE0 kh\xF4ng ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng, \u0111i\u1EC1u n\xE0y c\xF3 th\u1EC3 khi\u1EBFn Adhan \u0111\u1EBFn mu\u1ED9n. Vi\u1EC7c mi\u1EC5n tr\u1EEB cho \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng n\xE0y ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n ch\u1EA1m.",
  "Android will not delay this app\u2019s reminders while it is saving power.": "Android s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng tr\xEC ho\xE3n c\xE1c l\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFc c\u1EE7a \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng n\xE0y trong khi \u0111ang ti\u1EBFt ki\u1EC7m pin.",
  "Another sets no minimum at all, and counts any bleeding as hayd once it has begun.": "M\u1ED9t quan \u0111i\u1EC3m kh\xE1c kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EB7t m\u1EE9c t\u1ED1i thi\u1EC3u n\xE0o c\u1EA3, v\xE0 t\xEDnh m\u1ECDi s\u1EF1 ra m\xE1u l\xE0 hayd m\u1ED9t khi n\xF3 \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u.",
  "Anxiety and distress": "Lo \xE2u v\xE0 kh\u1ED1n kh\xF3",
  "Any fast already missed in the hayd portion is still owed, and belongs on the Qada screen.": "B\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 ng\xE0y chay n\xE0o \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF l\u1EE1 trong ph\u1EA7n hayd v\u1EABn c\xF2n n\u1EE3, v\xE0 thu\u1ED9c v\u1EC1 m\xE0n h\xECnh Qada.",
  "Any other reason": "B\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 l\xFD do n\xE0o kh\xE1c",
  "Any time": "B\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 l\xFAc n\xE0o",
  "Anything perfumed \u2014 scented product in ihram breaks a restriction": "B\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 th\u1EE9 g\xEC c\xF3 m\xF9i th\u01A1m \u2014 d\xF9ng s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m c\xF3 m\xF9i khi \u1EDF trong ihram l\xE0 vi ph\u1EA1m m\u1ED9t \u0111i\u1EC1u c\u1EA5m",
  "App language": "Ng\xF4n ng\u1EEF \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng",
  "Appearance": "Giao di\u1EC7n",
  "Apply before you set out, and again before Sa\u2019i, on dry skin": "Thoa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi b\u1EA1n kh\u1EDFi h\xE0nh, v\xE0 thoa l\u1EA1i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi l\xE0m Sa\u2019i, tr\xEAn da kh\xF4",
  "Arabic": "Ti\u1EBFng \u1EA2 R\u1EADp",
  "Arabic and English together": "Ti\u1EBFng \u1EA2 R\u1EADp v\xE0 ti\u1EBFng Anh c\xF9ng l\xFAc",
  "Arabic font": "Ph\xF4ng ch\u1EEF \u1EA2 R\u1EADp",
  "Arabic interface": "Giao di\u1EC7n ti\u1EBFng \u1EA2 R\u1EADp",
  "Arabic reciters": "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc ti\u1EBFng \u1EA2 R\u1EADp",
