  "Commentary on the Quran, in the language you read it in. Tafsir is one scholar\u2019s reading, not the text itself.": "L\u1EDDi b\xECnh lu\u1EADn v\u1EC1 Kinh Quran, b\u1EB1ng ng\xF4n ng\u1EEF b\u1EA1n d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECDc. Tafsir l\xE0 c\xE1ch \u0111\u1ECDc c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i ch\xEDnh v\u0103n b\u1EA3n.",
  "Commentary you have kept": "L\u1EDDi b\xECnh lu\u1EADn b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 gi\u1EEF",
  "Commonly observed, and disputed. The reports about it are not all sound.": "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c nhi\u1EC1u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u1EF1c h\xE0nh, v\xE0 c\u0169ng c\xF3 tranh lu\u1EADn. C\xE1c b\xE0i truy\u1EC1n thu\u1EADt v\u1EC1 n\xF3 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC1u x\xE1c th\u1EF1c.",
