  "Complete Surah recordings \u2014 one continuous track per Surah.": "C\xE1c b\u1EA3n ghi to\xE0n b\u1ED9 ch\u01B0\u01A1ng \u2014 m\u1ED7i ch\u01B0\u01A1ng m\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n li\xEAn t\u1EE5c.",
  "Complete dryness: nothing at all is seen when checking, so the place remains clean and dry. For many women this is the clearer of the two signs, and it is reached a day or two after the discharge stops.": "S\u1EF1 kh\xF4 ho\xE0n to\xE0n: kh\xF4ng th\u1EA5y g\xEC c\u1EA3 khi ki\u1EC3m tra, n\xEAn v\xF9ng \u0111\xF3 v\u1EABn s\u1EA1ch v\xE0 kh\xF4. V\u1EDBi nhi\u1EC1u ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF, \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 d\u1EA5u hi\u1EC7u r\xF5 r\xE0ng h\u01A1n trong hai d\u1EA5u hi\u1EC7u, v\xE0 n\xF3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1ED9t ho\u1EB7c hai ng\xE0y sau khi ch\u1EA5t d\u1ECBch ng\u1EEBng ti\u1EBFt ra.",
