  "Completed journeys": "C\xE1c h\xE0nh tr\xECnh \u0111\xE3 ho\xE0n th\xE0nh",
  "Completed readings": "C\xE1c l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\xE3 ho\xE0n th\xE0nh",
  "Concise educational overviews with transparent Qur\u2019an and Hadith references. Detailed rulings should be learned from a qualified local scholar.": "C\xE1c b\xE0i t\u1ED5ng quan gi\xE1o d\u1EE5c ng\u1EAFn g\u1ECDn v\u1EDBi c\xE1c tham chi\u1EBFu Kinh Quran v\xE0 Hadith r\xF5 r\xE0ng. C\xE1c ph\xE1n quy\u1EBFt chi ti\u1EBFt n\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ECDc t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBa ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u1EE7 n\u0103ng l\u1EF1c.",
  "Conclude with Witr according to your practice.": "K\u1EBFt th\xFAc b\u1EB1ng Witr theo th\u1EF1c h\xE0nh c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n.",
