  "Continue": "Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c",
  "Continue reading": "Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c \u0111\u1ECDc",
  "Continue to be asked. Nothing is scheduled unless you allow it, and every reminder can be switched off later in Settings.": "S\u1EBD ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ECFi. Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xEAn l\u1ECBch tr\u1EEB khi b\u1EA1n cho ph\xE9p, v\xE0 m\u1ECDi l\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFc \u0111\u1EC1u c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EAFt \u0111i sau n\xE0y trong C\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t.",
  "Continue your reading with a few mindful verses.": "Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c vi\u1EC7c \u0111\u1ECDc c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n v\u1EDBi v\xE0i c\xE2u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c suy ng\u1EABm.",
