  "Cycle and purity records, the days after childbirth, and the fasts owed because of them \u2014 kept only on this device. Nothing is uploaded and no account is involved.": "H\u1ED3 s\u01A1 chu k\u1EF3 v\xE0 thanh s\u1EA1ch, nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y sau sinh, v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y chay c\xF2n n\u1EE3 v\xEC ch\xFAng \u2014 ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y. Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA3i l\xEAn v\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n n\xE0o li\xEAn quan.",
