  "Deodorant without perfume; a crystal or alum stick is the safe bet": "Ch\u1EA5t kh\u1EED m\xF9i kh\xF4ng c\xF3 h\u01B0\u01A1ng li\u1EC7u; m\u1ED9t th\u1ECFi ph\xE8n chua l\xE0 l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn an to\xE0n",
  "Details differ between legal schools; follow the imam and seek local scholarly guidance.": "C\xE1c chi ti\u1EBFt kh\xE1c nhau gi\u1EEFa c\xE1c tr\u01B0\u1EDDng ph\xE1i ph\xE1p l\xFD; h\xE3y theo imam v\xE0 t\xECm s\u1EF1 h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn c\u1EE7a h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBa ph\u01B0\u01A1ng.",
  "Deutsch": "Ti\u1EBFng \u0110\u1EE9c",
  "Dhikr": "Dhikr",
  "Dhikr counter": "B\u1ED9 \u0111\u1EBFm Dhikr",
  "Dhikr, dua, charity, kindness to family, listening to the Quran, and seeking knowledge all continue. Nothing about these days closes the door to a person\u2019s relationship with Allah \u2014 they are part of the worship of a woman\u2019s life, not a suspension of it. Many find the regular adhkar of morning and evening especially valuable here, since the habit continues even when the prayer does not.": "Dhikr, l\u1EDDi c\u1EA7u xin, b\u1ED1 th\xED, s\u1EF1 t\u1EED t\u1EBF v\u1EDBi gia \u0111\xECnh, l\u1EAFng nghe Kinh Quran v\xE0 t\xECm c\u1EA7u tri th\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EC1u v\u1EABn ti\u1EBFp di\u1EC5n. Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC trong nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y n\xE0y kh\xE9p l\u1EA1i c\xE1nh c\u1EEDa v\u1EC1 m\u1ED1i quan h\u1EC7 c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EDBi Allah \u2014 ch\xFAng l\xE0 m\u1ED9t ph\u1EA7n c\u1EE7a s\u1EF1 th\u1EDD ph\u1EE5ng trong \u0111\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF, ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i s\u1EF1 t\u1EA1m ng\u01B0ng c\u1EE7a n\xF3. Nhi\u1EC1u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u1EA5y c\xE1c adhkar \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\u1EB7n c\u1EE7a bu\u1ED5i s\xE1ng v\xE0 bu\u1ED5i t\u1ED1i \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t qu\xFD gi\xE1 \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y, v\xEC th\xF3i quen \u1EA5y v\u1EABn ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c ngay c\u1EA3 khi l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n kh\xF4ng.",
