  "Download this collection to read it without a connection.": "T\u1EA3i b\u1ED9 s\u01B0u t\u1EADp n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECDc m\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i.",
