  "Downloads": "T\u1EA3i xu\u1ED1ng",
  "Downloads the Arabic script and translation you have selected, one Surah at a time. Preparation continues while you use other screens and prioritizes your current reading Surah.": "T\u1EA3i b\u1EA3n th\u1EA3o ti\u1EBFng \u1EA2 R\u1EADp v\xE0 b\u1EA3n d\u1ECBch b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn, m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n m\u1ED9t ch\u01B0\u01A1ng. Vi\u1EC7c chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c trong khi b\u1EA1n d\xF9ng c\xE1c m\xE0n h\xECnh kh\xE1c v\xE0 \u01B0u ti\xEAn ch\u01B0\u01A1ng b\u1EA1n \u0111ang \u0111\u1ECDc.",
  "Drawn at random from what you are working on.": "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1ECDn ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn t\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng g\xEC b\u1EA1n \u0111ang h\u1ECDc.",
  "Dua": "Dua",
  "Dua and remembrance": "L\u1EDDi c\u1EA7u xin v\xE0 s\u1EF1 t\u01B0\u1EDFng nh\u1EDB",
  "Dua is worship, and it is never closed. The days in which the prayer is lifted from a woman are, by many accounts, days in which her asking is especially her own \u2014 nothing stands between her and it.": "L\u1EDDi c\u1EA7u xin l\xE0 m\u1ED9t s\u1EF1 th\u1EDD ph\u1EE5ng, v\xE0 n\xF3 kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD b\u1ECB \u0111\xF3ng l\u1EA1i. Nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y m\xE0 l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c mi\u1EC5n cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF, theo nhi\u1EC1u ngu\u1ED3n, l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y m\xE0 vi\u1EC7c c\u1EA7u xin c\u1EE7a c\xF4 \u1EA5y \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t thu\u1ED9c v\u1EC1 ri\xEAng c\xF4 \u1EA5y \u2014 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\u1EE9ng gi\u1EEFa c\xF4 \u1EA5y v\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u \u0111\xF3.",
