  "Full-Surah reciter": "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc to\xE0n b\u1ED9 ch\u01B0\u01A1ng",
  "Full-Surah reciters": "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc to\xE0n b\u1ED9 ch\u01B0\u01A1ng",
  "GIVEN": "\u0110\xC3 CHO",
  "GOAL \xB7 {g}": "M\u1EE4C TI\xCAU \xB7 {g}",
  "GOD [Himself] proffers evidence - and [so do] the angels and all who are endowed with knowledge - that there is no deity save Him, the Upholder of Equity: there is no deity save Him, the Almighty, the Truly Wise.": "ALLAH [T\u1EF1 Ng\xE0i] \u0111\u01B0a ra b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng \u2014 v\xE0 [c\u1EA3] c\xE1c thi\xEAn th\u1EA7n c\xF9ng m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ban tri th\u1EE9c \u2014 r\u1EB1ng kh\xF4ng c\xF3 th\u1EA7n linh n\xE0o ngo\xE0i Ng\xE0i, \u0110\u1EA5ng G\xECn Gi\u1EEF C\xF4ng B\u1EB1ng: kh\xF4ng c\xF3 th\u1EA7n linh n\xE0o ngo\xE0i Ng\xE0i, \u0110\u1EA5ng To\xE0n N\u0103ng, \u0110\u1EA5ng V\xF4 C\xF9ng S\xE1ng Su\u1ED1t.",
  "GOLD NISAB": "NISAB V\xC0NG",
  "GROSS ASSETS": "T\u1ED4NG T\xC0I S\u1EA2N",
  "GUIDES": "H\u01AF\u1EDANG D\u1EAAN",
  "General": "Chung",
  "General Authority for the care of the Two Holy Mosques": "T\u1ED5ng c\u1EE5c qu\u1EA3n l\xFD Hai Th\xE1nh \u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng",
  "Gentle, local reminders": "L\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFc nh\u1EB9 nh\xE0ng, ngay tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB",
  "Get started": "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u",
  "Get the recordings": "T\u1EA3i c\xE1c b\u1EA3n ghi",
  "Ghusl": "Ghusl",
  "Ghusl is for the prayer, not the fast": "Ghusl l\xE0 cho l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i cho vi\u1EC7c nh\u1ECBn chay",
  "Ghusl is not required by the bleeding itself; it is for the hayd that preceded it.": "L\u1EC5 ghusl kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i do ch\xEDnh s\u1EF1 ra m\xE1u \u0111\xF2i h\u1ECFi; n\xF3 d\xE0nh cho k\u1EF3 hayd \u0111\xE3 x\u1EA3y ra tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3.",
  "Ghusl once, now \u2014 the days that follow are days of prayer, not days off.": "H\xE3y l\xE0m l\u1EC5 ghusl m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n, ngay b\xE2y gi\u1EDD \u2014 nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y ti\u1EBFp theo l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y c\u1EA7u nguy\u1EC7n, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i ng\xE0y ngh\u1EC9.",
  "Ghusl once, now \u2014 the major impurity of the hayd is lifted by it, and the bleeding that continues does not bring it back.": "H\xE3y l\xE0m l\u1EC5 ghusl m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n, ngay b\xE2y gi\u1EDD \u2014 s\u1EF1 \xF4 u\u1EBF l\u1EDBn c\u1EE7a k\u1EF3 hayd \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA9y s\u1EA1ch b\u1EDFi n\xF3, v\xE0 vi\u1EC7c ra m\xE1u ti\u1EBFp di\u1EC5n kh\xF4ng l\xE0m n\xF3 quay tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i.",
  "Girl": "B\xE9 g\xE1i",
  "Girls": "B\xE9 g\xE1i",
  "Give charity and reconcile with others.": "H\xE3y b\u1ED1 th\xED v\xE0 l\xE0m h\xF2a v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xE1c.",
  "Give early enough to reach them before Eid prayer.": "H\xE3y cho s\u1EDBm \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EBFn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ECD tr\u01B0\u1EDBc l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n Eid.",
  "Given": "\u0110\xE3 cho",
