  "Gold and silver prices and the currency rates Zakat is worked out from, and city search when a place is not in the list kept on the device.": "Gi\xE1 v\xE0ng v\xE0 b\u1EA1c c\xF9ng c\xE1c t\u1EF7 gi\xE1 m\xE0 Zakat \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xEDnh t\u1EEB \u0111\xF3, v\xE0 vi\u1EC7c t\xECm th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 khi m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m kh\xF4ng c\xF3 trong danh s\xE1ch \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB.",
  "Gold and silver prices could not be fetched, so nothing can be worked out yet.": "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\u1EA3i gi\xE1 v\xE0ng v\xE0 b\u1EA1c, n\xEAn hi\u1EC7n ch\u01B0a t\xEDnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\xEC.",
  "Gold price per gram": "Gi\xE1 v\xE0ng m\u1ED7i gam",
