  "Leave after sunset, pray, and gather pebbles": "Kh\u1EDFi h\xE0nh sau khi m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi l\u1EB7n, c\u1EA7u nguy\u1EC7n, v\xE0 nh\u1EB7t s\u1ECFi",
  "Leave at home": "\u0110\u1EC3 \u1EDF nh\xE0",
  "Leave \u2018Arafah after sunset \u2014 before dawn \u2014 and go to Muzdalifah, where you pray Maghrib and \u2018Isha together and spend the night. Gather the pebbles for the stoning here, then leave for Mina before or around dawn.": "H\xE3y r\u1EDDi \u2018Arafah sau khi m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi l\u1EB7n \u2014 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc r\u1EA1ng \u0111\xF4ng \u2014 v\xE0 \u0111i \u0111\u1EBFn Muzdalifah, n\u01A1i b\u1EA1n c\u1EA7u nguy\u1EC7n Maghrib v\xE0 \u2018Isha g\u1ED9p l\u1EA1i v\xE0 qua \u0111\xEAm. H\xE3y nh\u1EB7t s\u1ECFi \u0111\u1EC3 n\xE9m \u0111\xE1 t\u1EA1i \u0111\xE2y, r\u1ED3i l\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111i Mina tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ho\u1EB7c v\xE0o kho\u1EA3ng r\u1EA1ng \u0111\xF4ng.",
  "Left out: downloaded recitation audio, which lives as files on this device and can be downloaded again, and the backup password itself.": "Kh\xF4ng bao g\u1ED3m: \xE2m thanh t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\xE3 t\u1EA3i, th\u1EE9 t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i d\u01B0\u1EDBi d\u1EA1ng c\xE1c t\u1EC7p tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y v\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA3i l\u1EA1i, v\xE0 ch\xEDnh m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u sao l\u01B0u.",
