  "List what you own, subtract what falls due, and compare what is left with the nisab. Prices and exchange rates are fetched live where they are reachable and kept on this device when they are not. This is arithmetic, not a ruling \u2014 take the details to a scholar.": "H\xE3y li\u1EC7t k\xEA nh\u1EEFng g\xEC b\u1EA1n s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu, tr\u1EEB \u0111i nh\u1EEFng g\xEC \u0111\u1EBFn h\u1EA1n, v\xE0 so s\xE1nh ph\u1EA7n c\xF2n l\u1EA1i v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng nisab. Gi\xE1 v\xE0 t\u1EF7 gi\xE1 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA3i tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp \u1EDF n\u01A1i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y khi kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 ph\xE9p t\xEDnh, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i m\u1ED9t ph\xE1n quy\u1EBFt \u2014 h\xE3y \u0111em c\xE1c chi ti\u1EBFt \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1ED9t h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3.",
