  "Mark each rite as you complete it. Counts and notes are saved as you go.": "H\xE3y \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u t\u1EEBng nghi th\u1EE9c khi b\u1EA1n ho\xE0n th\xE0nh. C\xE1c s\u1ED1 \u0111\u1EBFm v\xE0 ghi ch\xFA \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u trong l\xFAc b\u1EA1n th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n.",
