  "Measured as it sits on the device, not as it arrived. Text is compressed on the way in and not once stored, so a translation that downloads as 3 MB takes 11 MB here.": "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111o theo dung l\u01B0\u1EE3ng tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i theo dung l\u01B0\u1EE3ng khi t\u1EA3i v\u1EC1. V\u0103n b\u1EA3n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xE9n tr\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng truy\u1EC1n v\xE0o v\xE0 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xE9n khi \u0111\xE3 l\u01B0u, n\xEAn m\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n d\u1ECBch t\u1EA3i v\u1EC1 l\xE0 3 MB s\u1EBD chi\u1EBFm 11 MB \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y.",
