  "Quran Audio": "\xC2m thanh Kinh Quran",
  "Quran TV and Sunnah TV play right here, from the broadcaster\u2019s own stream. The other channels open outside this app, because carrying them here would need rights the app does not hold.": "Quran TV v\xE0 Sunnah TV \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE1t ngay t\u1EA1i \u0111\xE2y, t\u1EEB lu\u1ED3ng ph\xE1t c\u1EE7a ch\xEDnh \u0111\xE0i. C\xE1c k\xEAnh kh\xE1c m\u1EDF b\xEAn ngo\xE0i \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng n\xE0y, v\xEC vi\u1EC7c mang ch\xFAng v\xE0o \u0111\xE2y s\u1EBD c\u1EA7n nh\u1EEFng quy\u1EC1n m\xE0 \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng kh\xF4ng c\xF3.",
