  "Quran text, hadith, the Names and the supplications come from the sources named in the app. Rulings and guidance are summarised for learning; for a matter that affects your worship or your obligations, ask a qualified scholar. This app is not a source of legal or religious authority.": "V\u0103n b\u1EA3n Kinh Quran, Hadith, c\xE1c T\xEAn g\u1ECDi v\xE0 c\xE1c l\u1EDDi c\u1EA7u xin \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng ngu\u1ED3n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xEAu trong \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng. C\xE1c ph\xE1n quy\u1EBFt v\xE0 h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xF3m t\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EC3 h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp; v\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0111\u1EBFn s\u1EF1 th\u1EDD ph\u1EE5ng hay ngh\u0129a v\u1EE5 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, h\xE3y h\u1ECFi m\u1ED9t h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EE7 n\u0103ng l\u1EF1c. \u1EE8ng d\u1EE5ng n\xE0y kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 m\u1ED9t ngu\u1ED3n c\xF3 th\u1EA9m quy\u1EC1n ph\xE1p l\xFD hay t\xF4n gi\xE1o.",
  "Quran text, prayer times, hadith, the Names, supplications and the countdown to Hajj come from api.islamicdata.uz. Recitation audio comes from cdn.islamic.network. The adhan recordings you choose are downloaded from audio.islamicdata.uz. Gold and silver prices used by the Zakat calculator come from misc.islamicdata.uz. Each of these receives the request needed to answer it and nothing about you.": "V\u0103n b\u1EA3n Kinh Quran, gi\u1EDD l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n, Hadith, c\xE1c T\xEAn g\u1ECDi, c\xE1c l\u1EDDi c\u1EA7u xin v\xE0 vi\u1EC7c \u0111\u1EBFm ng\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EBFn Hajj \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EEB api.islamicdata.uz. \xC2m thanh t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EEB cdn.islamic.network. C\xE1c b\u1EA3n ghi Adhan b\u1EA1n ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA3i t\u1EEB audio.islamicdata.uz. Gi\xE1 v\xE0ng v\xE0 b\u1EA1c m\xE0 m\xE1y t\xEDnh Zakat d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EEB misc.islamicdata.uz. M\u1ED7i ngu\u1ED3n trong s\u1ED1 n\xE0y ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EADn y\xEAu c\u1EA7u c\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFt \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi n\xF3, v\xE0 kh\xF4ng nh\u1EADn \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC v\u1EC1 b\u1EA1n.",
