  "Recitation stays the Arabic Qur\u2019an. This adds a voice in your own language underneath it.": "B\u1EA3n t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc v\u1EABn l\xE0 Kinh Quran b\u1EB1ng ti\u1EBFng \u1EA2 R\u1EADp. \u0110i\u1EC1u n\xE0y th\xEAm m\u1ED9t gi\u1ECDng n\xF3i b\u1EB1ng ng\xF4n ng\u1EEF c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n b\xEAn d\u01B0\u1EDBi.",
  "Recitation streams live from attributed public sources. Playback, recents and playlists stay on this device.": "B\u1EA3n t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE1t tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp t\u1EEB c\xE1c ngu\u1ED3n c\xF4ng khai \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ghi c\xF4ng. Vi\u1EC7c ph\xE1t, c\xE1c m\u1EE5c g\u1EA7n \u0111\xE2y v\xE0 danh s\xE1ch ph\xE1t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y.",
