  "Record a gift": "Ghi nh\u1EADn m\u1ED9t m\xF3n qu\xE0",
  "Record a start and an end for each cycle.": "H\xE3y ghi ng\xE0y b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xE0 ng\xE0y k\u1EBFt th\xFAc cho m\u1ED7i chu k\u1EF3.",
  "Record as not fasted": "Ghi nh\u1EADn l\xE0 kh\xF4ng nh\u1ECBn chay",
  "Record the birth when it happens and the counter follows the days. Purity is marked the day the bleeding stops.": "H\xE3y ghi nh\u1EADn ca sinh khi n\xF3 x\u1EA3y ra v\xE0 b\u1ED9 \u0111\u1EBFm s\u1EBD theo d\xF5i c\xE1c ng\xE0y. Ng\xE0y thanh s\u1EA1ch \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u l\xE0 ng\xE0y vi\u1EC7c ra m\xE1u d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i.",
  "Record the bleeding on the Cycle screen so your own pattern stays accurate.": "H\xE3y ghi l\u1EA1i vi\u1EC7c ra m\xE1u tr\xEAn m\xE0n h\xECnh Chu k\u1EF3 \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EABu h\xECnh c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n lu\xF4n ch\xEDnh x\xE1c.",
  "Record the days as they come. The averages and the prediction are worked out from your own history \u2014 nothing is assumed about what your cycle should look like.": "H\xE3y ghi l\u1EA1i c\xE1c ng\xE0y khi ch\xFAng \u0111\u1EBFn. C\xE1c gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB trung b\xECnh v\xE0 d\u1EF1 \u0111o\xE1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xEDnh t\u1EEB l\u1ECBch s\u1EED c\u1EE7a ri\xEAng b\u1EA1n \u2014 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC b\u1ECB gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBnh v\u1EC1 vi\u1EC7c chu k\u1EF3 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n n\xEAn tr\xF4ng nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\xE0o.",
  "Record these days so your own pattern stays accurate.": "H\xE3y ghi l\u1EA1i nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EABu h\xECnh c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n lu\xF4n ch\xEDnh x\xE1c.",
  "Record today as a Ramadan fast": "Ghi nh\u1EADn h\xF4m nay l\xE0 ng\xE0y chay Ramadan",
