  "Rehydration salts, painkillers, throat lozenges, upset-stomach remedy": "Mu\u1ED1i b\xF9 n\u01B0\u1EDBc, thu\u1ED1c gi\u1EA3m \u0111au, vi\xEAn ng\u1EADm tr\u1ECB ho, thu\u1ED1c tr\u1ECB r\u1ED1i lo\u1EA1n ti\xEAu h\xF3a",
