  "Remembrance for 132 occasions, in Arabic with transliteration and meaning. Each entry keeps the reference the source gives for it.": "L\u1EDDi t\u01B0\u1EDFng nh\u1EDB cho 132 d\u1ECBp, b\u1EB1ng ti\u1EBFng \u1EA2 R\u1EADp k\xE8m chuy\u1EC3n ng\u1EEF v\xE0 \xFD ngh\u0129a. M\u1ED7i m\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EC1u gi\u1EEF tham chi\u1EBFu m\xE0 ngu\u1ED3n cung c\u1EA5p cho n\xF3.",
  "Remembrance, trusted learning and practical tools\u2014organized by purpose rather than hidden in a feature grid.": "S\u1EF1 t\u01B0\u1EDFng nh\u1EDB, s\u1EF1 h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp \u0111\xE1ng tin c\u1EADy v\xE0 c\xE1c c\xF4ng c\u1EE5 thi\u1EBFt th\u1EF1c \u2014 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EAFp x\u1EBFp theo m\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch thay v\xEC b\u1ECB gi\u1EA5u trong m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EDBi t\xEDnh n\u0103ng.",
  "Remembrance, trusted learning and step-by-step guidance\u2014organized by purpose rather than hidden in a feature grid.": "S\u1EF1 t\u01B0\u1EDFng nh\u1EDB, s\u1EF1 h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp \u0111\xE1ng tin c\u1EADy v\xE0 h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn t\u1EEBng b\u01B0\u1EDBc \u2014 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EAFp x\u1EBFp theo m\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch thay v\xEC b\u1ECB gi\u1EA5u trong m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EDBi t\xEDnh n\u0103ng.",
