  "Rub the body with the hand where the water can reach, and finish by washing the feet.": "H\xE3y xoa c\u01A1 th\u1EC3 b\u1EB1ng tay \u1EDF nh\u1EEFng ch\u1ED7 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EDBi, v\xE0 k\u1EBFt th\xFAc b\u1EB1ng vi\u1EC7c r\u1EEDa hai b\xE0n ch\xE2n.",
  "Rub the hair gently so water reaches the scalp, then pour three handfuls over the head.": "H\xE3y xoa nh\u1EB9 m\xE1i t\xF3c \u0111\u1EC3 n\u01B0\u1EDBc th\u1EA5m \u0111\u1EBFn da \u0111\u1EA7u, r\u1ED3i d\u1ED9i ba v\u1ED1c n\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xEAn \u0111\u1EA7u.",
