  "Sahih Muslim \u2014 the hadith of Umm Atiyya on the signs of purity": "Sahih Muslim \u2014 Hadith c\u1EE7a Umm Atiyya v\u1EC1 c\xE1c d\u1EA5u hi\u1EC7u thanh s\u1EA1ch",
  "Sahih al-Bukhari and Muslim \u2014 \u201CDo what the pilgrim does, except do not circumambulate the House\u201D": "Sahih al-Bukhari v\xE0 Muslim \u2014 \u201CH\xE3y l\xE0m nh\u1EEFng g\xEC ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\xE0nh h\u01B0\u01A1ng l\xE0m, ngo\u1EA1i tr\u1EEB vi\u1EC7c \u0111i v\xF2ng quanh Ng\xF4i Nh\xE0\u201D",
  "Sahih al-Bukhari, Kitab al-Hayd \u2014 the hadith of Aisha on making up fasts, not prayers": "Sahih al-Bukhari, Kitab al-Hayd \u2014 Hadith c\u1EE7a Aisha v\u1EC1 vi\u1EC7c b\xF9 nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y chay, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i c\xE1c l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n",
  "Said for": "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xF3i cho",
  "Salah Tracker": "Theo d\xF5i l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n",
  "Salah counts the prayers you mark on the Prayer screen. Reading counts the verses you mark in the reader and the Mushaf pages you open. Dhikr comes from the Tasbih counter, and hifz from every verse you rate in recall practice. The week is kept on this device only.": "Salah \u0111\u1EBFm nh\u1EEFng l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u tr\xEAn m\xE0n h\xECnh L\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n. Ph\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\u1EBFm nh\u1EEFng c\xE2u b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u trong tr\xECnh \u0111\u1ECDc v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng trang Mushaf b\u1EA1n m\u1EDF. Dhikr \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EEB b\u1ED9 \u0111\u1EBFm Tasbih, v\xE0 hifz t\u1EEB m\u1ED7i c\xE2u b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE1nh gi\xE1 trong ph\u1EA7n luy\u1EC7n nh\u1EDB l\u1EA1i. Tu\u1EA7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y m\xE0 th\xF4i.",
  "Salah counts the prayers you mark on the Prayer screen. Reading counts the verses you mark in the reader and the Mushaf pages you open. Dhikr comes from the Tasbih counter, and hifz from every verse you rate in recall practice. Thirty days are kept, on this device only, and nothing is uploaded.": "Salah \u0111\u1EBFm nh\u1EEFng l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u tr\xEAn m\xE0n h\xECnh L\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n. Ph\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\u1EBFm nh\u1EEFng c\xE2u b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u trong tr\xECnh \u0111\u1ECDc v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng trang Mushaf b\u1EA1n m\u1EDF. Dhikr \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EEB b\u1ED9 \u0111\u1EBFm Tasbih, v\xE0 hifz t\u1EEB m\u1ED7i c\xE2u b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE1nh gi\xE1 trong ph\u1EA7n luy\u1EC7n nh\u1EDB l\u1EA1i. Ba m\u01B0\u01A1i ng\xE0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF, ch\u1EC9 tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y, v\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA3i l\xEAn.",
  "Salat al-Janazah is a communal obligation and is performed standing, without bowing or prostration.": "Salat al-Janazah l\xE0 m\u1ED9t ngh\u0129a v\u1EE5 c\u1EE7a c\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1ED3ng v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n khi \u0111ang \u0111\u1EE9ng, kh\xF4ng c\xFAi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\xE0 kh\xF4ng qu\u1EF3 l\u1EA1y.",
  "Sample unavailable": "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111o\u1EA1n m\u1EABu",
  "Sandals already broken in \u2014 never new ones for this trip": "D\xE9p \u0111\xE3 \u0111i quen \u2014 kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD mang d\xE9p m\u1EDBi cho chuy\u1EBFn \u0111i n\xE0y",
