  "Saving\u2026": "\u0110ang l\u01B0u\u2026",
  "Say it, then check.": "H\xE3y n\xF3i, r\u1ED3i ki\u1EC3m tra.",
  "Sa\u2018i between Safa and Marwah": "Sa\u2018i gi\u1EEFa Safa v\xE0 Marwah",
  "Scarves that pin easily, and more pins than you think you need": "Nh\u1EEFng chi\u1EBFc kh\u0103n d\u1EC5 ghim, v\xE0 nhi\u1EC1u ghim h\u01A1n b\u1EA1n ngh\u0129",
  "Schedule": "L\u1ECBch tr\xECnh",
  "Scheduling\u2026": "\u0110ang l\xEAn l\u1ECBch\u2026",
  "Scheherazade": "Scheherazade",
  "Scheherazade New": "Scheherazade New",
  "Scholars differ on which of the two to measure against. The lower threshold brings more wealth into Zakat; take the choice to someone you trust.": "C\xE1c h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3 b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED3ng v\u1EC1 vi\u1EC7c n\xEAn \u0111o theo m\u1EE9c n\xE0o trong hai m\u1EE9c. Ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng th\u1EA5p h\u01A1n \u0111\u01B0a nhi\u1EC1u t\xE0i s\u1EA3n h\u01A1n v\xE0o di\u1EC7n ch\u1ECBu Zakat; h\xE3y \u0111em s\u1EF1 l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn n\xE0y \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\xE0 b\u1EA1n tin t\u01B0\u1EDFng.",
  "Scholars differ. Reciting from memory is widely permitted; touching the physical mushaf is not, since it requires purification. On screens and phones the question turns on whether a device counts as a mushaf \u2014 many contemporary scholars permit reading and reciting from a phone for that reason, while others advise limiting it to looking and listening. Follow the position of a scholar you trust, and keep the Quran close either way: listening to recitation is open to everyone, in every state.": "C\xE1c h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3 b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED3ng. Vi\u1EC7c t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc t\u1EEB tr\xED nh\u1EDB \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE9p r\u1ED9ng r\xE3i; vi\u1EC7c ch\u1EA1m v\xE0o Mushaf v\u1EADt l\xFD th\xEC kh\xF4ng, v\xEC n\xF3 \u0111\xF2i h\u1ECFi s\u1EF1 thanh s\u1EA1ch. V\u1EDBi m\xE0n h\xECnh v\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i, c\xE2u h\u1ECFi xoay quanh vi\u1EC7c m\u1ED9t thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB c\xF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c coi l\xE0 Mushaf hay kh\xF4ng \u2014 nhi\u1EC1u h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EDDi cho ph\xE9p \u0111\u1ECDc v\xE0 t\u1EE5ng t\u1EEB \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i v\xEC l\xFD do \u0111\xF3, trong khi nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xE1c khuy\xEAn n\xEAn gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n \u1EDF vi\u1EC7c nh\xECn v\xE0 nghe. H\xE3y theo quan \u0111i\u1EC3m c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3 m\xE0 b\u1EA1n tin t\u01B0\u1EDFng, v\xE0 d\xF9 theo c\xE1ch n\xE0o c\u0169ng h\xE3y gi\u1EEF Kinh Quran g\u1EA7n b\xEAn m\xECnh: l\u1EAFng nghe b\u1EA3n t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc l\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u m\u1EDF ra cho m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, trong m\u1ECDi tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i.",
