  "Towelling weave rather than thin cotton, which goes see-through when you sweat": "Ch\u1ECDn v\u1EA3i d\u1EC7t ki\u1EC3u b\xF4ng t\u1EAFm thay v\xEC cotton m\u1ECFng, th\u1EE9 s\u1EBD b\u1ECB xuy\xEAn th\u1EA5u khi b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1ED5 m\u1ED3 h\xF4i",
  "Track your prayers": "Theo d\xF5i c\xE1c l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n",
