  "Trackers and calculators": "C\xE1c m\u1EE5c theo d\xF5i v\xE0 m\xE1y t\xEDnh",
  "Translation": "B\u1EA3n d\u1ECBch",
  "Translation Compare": "So s\xE1nh b\u1EA3n d\u1ECBch",
  "Translation and tafsir are not the Quran in the sense that recitation is \u2014 they are the study of it, and study is not closed to you. Many women find these days become the most attentive reading of their month, precisely because the pace slows and the hurry goes out of it.": "B\u1EA3n d\u1ECBch v\xE0 tafsir kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 Kinh Quran theo ngh\u0129a m\xE0 vi\u1EC7c t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc l\xE0 \u2014 ch\xFAng l\xE0 s\u1EF1 h\u1ECDc h\u1ECFi v\u1EC1 n\xF3, v\xE0 s\u1EF1 h\u1ECDc h\u1ECFi kh\xF4ng \u0111\xF3ng l\u1EA1i v\u1EDBi b\u1EA1n. Nhi\u1EC1u ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF nh\u1EADn ra nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y n\xE0y tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh kho\u1EA3ng th\u1EDDi gian \u0111\u1ECDc ch\u0103m ch\xFA nh\u1EA5t trong th\xE1ng c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD, ch\xEDnh v\xEC nh\u1ECBp \u0111\u1ED9 ch\u1EADm l\u1EA1i v\xE0 s\u1EF1 v\u1ED9i v\xE3 bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t kh\u1ECFi n\xF3.",
  "Translation audio": "\xC2m thanh b\u1EA3n d\u1ECBch",
  "Translation volume": "\xC2m l\u01B0\u1EE3ng b\u1EA3n d\u1ECBch",
  "Translations": "C\xE1c b\u1EA3n d\u1ECBch",
  "Translations explain meaning and do not replace the Arabic Quran. Edition attribution remains visible in the reader.": "C\xE1c b\u1EA3n d\u1ECBch gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch \xFD ngh\u0129a v\xE0 kh\xF4ng thay th\u1EBF Kinh Quran ti\u1EBFng \u1EA2 R\u1EADp. Ph\u1EA7n ghi c\xF4ng \u1EA5n b\u1EA3n v\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB trong tr\xECnh \u0111\u1ECDc.",
  "Transliteration": "Chuy\u1EC3n ng\u1EEF",
  "Travel": "Du h\xE0nh",
  "Travelling": "\u0110ang du h\xE0nh",
