  "Turn on the women\u2019s area": "B\u1EADt khu v\u1EF1c d\xE0nh cho n\u1EEF gi\u1EDBi",
  "Turn on this area": "B\u1EADt khu v\u1EF1c n\xE0y",
  "Two cycles needed": "C\u1EA7n hai chu k\u1EF3",
  "Two notifications sent \u2014 one quiet, one adhan.": "Hai th\xF4ng b\xE1o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1EEDi \u2014 m\u1ED9t \xEAm l\u1EB7ng, m\u1ED9t l\xE0 Adhan.",
  "Two or three interchangeable abayas \u2014 laundries wash same-day and cheaply": "Hai ho\u1EB7c ba chi\u1EBFc abaya c\xF3 th\u1EC3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i l\u1EABn nhau \u2014 c\xE1c ti\u1EC7m gi\u1EB7t \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y gi\u1EB7t trong ng\xE0y v\xE0 gi\xE1 r\u1EBB",
  "Two sets, not one \u2014 a wet set and a dry set": "Hai b\u1ED9, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i m\u1ED9t \u2014 m\u1ED9t b\u1ED9 \u01B0\u1EDBt v\xE0 m\u1ED9t b\u1ED9 kh\xF4",
  "Two worships are lifted in these days \u2014 the prayer and the fast \u2014 and they are lifted as a mercy, not held back as a loss. Nearly everything else you do is untouched by them: the remembrance, the listening, the study, the asking. All of it is still yours, and all of it is already here.": "Hai s\u1EF1 th\u1EDD ph\u1EE5ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c mi\u1EC5n trong nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y n\xE0y \u2014 l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n v\xE0 vi\u1EC7c nh\u1ECBn chay \u2014 v\xE0 ch\xFAng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c mi\u1EC5n nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t s\u1EF1 th\u01B0\u01A1ng x\xF3t, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i b\u1ECB gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t s\u1EF1 m\u1EA5t m\xE1t. H\u1EA7u nh\u01B0 m\u1ECDi \u0111i\u1EC1u kh\xE1c b\u1EA1n l\xE0m \u0111\u1EC1u kh\xF4ng b\u1ECB ch\xFAng \u0111\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1EBFn: s\u1EF1 t\u01B0\u1EDFng nh\u1EDB, vi\u1EC7c l\u1EAFng nghe, s\u1EF1 h\u1ECDc h\u1ECFi, vi\u1EC7c c\u1EA7u xin. T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 v\u1EABn l\xE0 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, v\xE0 t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 s\u1EB5n \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y.",
  "Two worships are lifted in these days, and they are lifted as a mercy rather than taken as a loss. Nothing here is owed back, and nothing needs to be made up except the fasts. Where the scholars differ, the difference is described rather than settled \u2014 take it to someone you trust, and do not let it become a weight. This app records and explains; it does not rule.": "Hai s\u1EF1 th\u1EDD ph\u1EE5ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c mi\u1EC5n trong nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y n\xE0y, v\xE0 ch\xFAng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c mi\u1EC5n nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t s\u1EF1 th\u01B0\u01A1ng x\xF3t ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i b\u1ECB l\u1EA5y \u0111i nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t s\u1EF1 m\u1EA5t m\xE1t. Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y ph\u1EA3i tr\u1EA3 l\u1EA1i, v\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC c\u1EA7n ph\u1EA3i b\xF9 ngo\u1EA1i tr\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y chay. \u1EDE n\u01A1i c\xE1c h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3 b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED3ng, s\u1EF1 kh\xE1c bi\u1EC7t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\xF4 t\u1EA3 ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ECBnh \u0111o\u1EA1t \u2014 h\xE3y \u0111em n\xF3 \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n tin t\u01B0\u1EDFng, v\xE0 \u0111\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EC3 n\xF3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t g\xE1nh n\u1EB7ng. \u1EE8ng d\u1EE5ng n\xE0y ghi l\u1EA1i v\xE0 gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch; n\xF3 kh\xF4ng ph\xE1n quy\u1EBFt.",
