  "Verse-by-verse files, one track per ayah, with translation audio and reader controls.": "C\xE1c t\u1EC7p t\u1EEBng c\xE2u, m\u1ED7i c\xE2u m\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n nh\u1EA1c, k\xE8m \xE2m thanh b\u1EA3n d\u1ECBch v\xE0 c\xE1c n\xFAt \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n tr\xECnh \u0111\u1ECDc.",
  "Verse-by-verse: one track for each ayah. Full-Surah: a complete recitation of the Surah.": "T\u1EEBng c\xE2u: m\u1ED7i c\xE2u m\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n nh\u1EA1c. To\xE0n b\u1ED9 ch\u01B0\u01A1ng: m\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n t\u1EE5ng \u0111\u1ECDc tr\u1ECDn v\u1EB9n c\u1EE7a ch\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\xF3.",
  "Verses": "C\xE2u",
  "Verses affirming the absolute oneness, independence and incomparability of Allah.": "Nh\u1EEFng c\xE2u kh\u1EB3ng \u0111\u1ECBnh s\u1EF1 duy nh\u1EA5t tuy\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED1i, s\u1EF1 t\u1EF1 h\u1EEFu v\xE0 s\u1EF1 v\xF4 song c\u1EE7a Allah.",
  "Verses under this are drawn more often. Anything you flag yourself counts as weak whatever it scores.": "Nh\u1EEFng c\xE2u d\u01B0\u1EDBi m\u1EE9c n\xE0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u01B0a ra th\u01B0\u1EDDng xuy\xEAn h\u01A1n. B\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 c\xE2u n\xE0o b\u1EA1n t\u1EF1 \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xEDnh l\xE0 y\u1EBFu b\u1EA5t k\u1EC3 \u0111i\u1EC3m c\u1EE7a n\xF3.",
