  "Waking up": "Th\u1EE9c d\u1EADy",
  "Walk from Safa to Marwah \u2014 that is one length \u2014 and back, seven lengths in all, finishing at Marwah. The Sa\u2018i is a rite of its own and is not shortened. Walk at your own pace; only the stretch between the two green markers is hurried.": "\u0110i b\u1ED9 t\u1EEB Safa \u0111\u1EBFn Marwah \u2014 \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u2014 v\xE0 quay l\u1EA1i, t\u1ED5ng c\u1ED9ng b\u1EA3y l\u01B0\u1EE3t, k\u1EBFt th\xFAc t\u1EA1i Marwah. Sa\u2018i l\xE0 m\u1ED9t nghi th\u1EE9c t\u1EF1 th\xE2n v\xE0 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c r\xFAt ng\u1EAFn. H\xE3y \u0111i v\u1EDBi nh\u1ECBp \u0111\u1ED9 c\u1EE7a ri\xEAng b\u1EA1n; ch\u1EC9 \u0111o\u1EA1n gi\u1EEFa hai c\u1ED9t xanh m\u1EDBi \u0111i nhanh.",
  "Wash away any impurity from the body.": "H\xE3y t\u1EA9y r\u1EEDa m\u1ECDi s\u1EF1 \xF4 u\u1EBF tr\xEAn c\u01A1 th\u1EC3.",
