  "Worked out from your attempts, never set by hand \u2014 so correcting one moves this immediately.": "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xEDnh t\u1EEB c\xE1c l\u1EA7n th\u1EED c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD do \u0111\u1EB7t th\u1EE7 c\xF4ng \u2014 n\xEAn s\u1EEDa m\u1ED9t c\xE1i l\xE0 con s\u1ED1 n\xE0y thay \u0111\u1ED5i ngay.",
