  "You can put a PIN in front of it, or use the face or fingerprint unlock your phone already has.": "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t m\u1ED9t m\xE3 PIN \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EAFn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3, ho\u1EB7c d\xF9ng m\u1EDF kh\xF3a khu\xF4n m\u1EB7t hay v\xE2n tay m\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 c\xF3.",
  "You can skip this and choose a place later in Settings.": "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ECF qua v\xE0 ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m sau trong C\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t.",
