  "Your PIN is saved on this device.": "M\xE3 PIN c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y.",
