  "Your content": "N\u1ED9i dung c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n",
  "Your cycle": "Chu k\u1EF3 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n",
  "Your cycle has varied a good deal, so this is a rough shape rather than a forecast.": "Chu k\u1EF3 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n bi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED9ng kh\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u, n\xEAn \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t h\xECnh d\xE1ng ph\xE1c th\u1EA3o h\u01A1n l\xE0 m\u1ED9t d\u1EF1 b\xE1o.",
  "Your cycle varies somewhat, so treat the outer days as a question mark.": "Chu k\u1EF3 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n c\xF3 ph\u1EA7n bi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED9ng, n\xEAn h\xE3y coi nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y ngo\xE0i c\xF9ng nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t d\u1EA5u h\u1ECFi.",
  "Your cycle, purity and the fasts you owe": "Chu k\u1EF3, s\u1EF1 thanh s\u1EA1ch v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y chay b\u1EA1n c\xF2n n\u1EE3",
  "Your fasts, missed days, and make-up record": "Nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y chay c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF l\u1EE1, v\xE0 s\u1ED5 ghi ng\xE0y b\xF9",
  "Your location never leaves this device. It is used to compute prayer times, Qibla and the fasting timetable, and you can clear it at any time.": "V\u1ECB tr\xED c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD r\u1EDDi kh\u1ECFi thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y. N\xF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 t\xEDnh gi\u1EDD l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n, Qibla v\xE0 th\u1EDDi kh\xF3a bi\u1EC3u nh\u1ECBn chay, v\xE0 b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 x\xF3a n\xF3 b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 l\xFAc n\xE0o.",
  "Your mail app has the report. It is also saved in Settings.": "\u1EE8ng d\u1EE5ng th\u01B0 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 b\xE1o c\xE1o. N\xF3 c\u0169ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u trong C\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t.",
  "Your net wealth is above the nisab": "T\xE0i s\u1EA3n r\xF2ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n cao h\u01A1n ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng nisab",
  "Your note on this verse": "Ghi ch\xFA c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n v\u1EC1 c\xE2u Kinh n\xE0y",
  "Your own cycle lengths and averages, a prediction worked out from your history rather than an assumption, purity and ghusl guidance, the post-natal days, and a running scorecard of make-up fasts.": "\u0110\u1ED9 d\xE0i v\xE0 gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB trung b\xECnh c\u1EE7a chu k\u1EF3 ri\xEAng b\u1EA1n, m\u1ED9t d\u1EF1 \u0111o\xE1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xEDnh t\u1EEB l\u1ECBch s\u1EED c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n thay v\xEC m\u1ED9t gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBnh, h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn v\u1EC1 s\u1EF1 thanh s\u1EA1ch v\xE0 l\u1EC5 ghusl, nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y sau sinh, v\xE0 m\u1ED9t b\u1EA3ng \u0111i\u1EC3m li\xEAn t\u1EE5c v\u1EC1 c\xE1c ng\xE0y chay b\xF9.",
