  "Your position": "V\u1ECB tr\xED c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n",
  "Your prayer record, the surah and verse you last read, bookmarks, notes, reminder settings, the language you chose and the city you picked are stored on the device itself. Clearing the app\u2019s storage or uninstalling removes them.": "H\u1ED3 s\u01A1 l\u1EC5 nguy\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, ch\u01B0\u01A1ng v\xE0 c\xE2u b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1ECDc l\u1EA7n cu\u1ED1i, d\u1EA5u trang, ghi ch\xFA, c\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t l\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFc, ng\xF4n ng\u1EEF b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn v\xE0 th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u ngay tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB. Vi\u1EC7c x\xF3a b\u1ED9 nh\u1EDB c\u1EE7a \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng ho\u1EB7c g\u1EE1 c\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t s\u1EBD x\xF3a ch\xFAng.",
  "Your recorded pattern: about {n} days.": "M\u1EABu h\xECnh \u0111\xE3 ghi c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n: kho\u1EA3ng {n} ng\xE0y.",
  "Your week in review": "Tu\u1EA7n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n nh\xECn l\u1EA1i",
  "Your worship stays private and your preferences remain on this device.": "S\u1EF1 th\u1EDD ph\u1EE5ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n lu\xF4n ri\xEAng t\u01B0 v\xE0 c\xE1c t\xF9y ch\u1ECDn c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n v\u1EABn \u1EDF tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y.",
  "Your worship, memorisation, notes, fasting and Qada are sealed with a password you choose. The password is never written down and cannot be recovered \u2014 not by this app, and not by anyone else.": "S\u1EF1 th\u1EDD ph\u1EE5ng, vi\u1EC7c ghi nh\u1EDB, ghi ch\xFA, nh\u1ECBn chay v\xE0 Qada c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ni\xEAm phong b\u1EB1ng m\u1ED9t m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u do b\u1EA1n ch\u1ECDn. M\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ghi l\u1EA1i v\xE0 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c \u2014 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i b\u1EDFi \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng n\xE0y, v\xE0 c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i b\u1EDFi b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 ai kh\xE1c.",
