  "Zakat is what is owed and has its own calculation. This is what you gave because you wanted to. Nothing here is sent anywhere.": "Zakat l\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u m\u1EAFc n\u1EE3 v\xE0 c\xF3 c\xE1ch t\xEDnh ri\xEAng c\u1EE7a n\xF3. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 cho v\xEC b\u1EA1n mu\u1ED1n. Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1EEDi \u0111i \u0111\xE2u.",
